Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.70,0:00:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Blessed by heaven and earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.03,0:00:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,the Chaos Pearl was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.81,0:00:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The Supreme Lord\Nsplit it into two.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.94,0:00:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The celestial energy within\Nbecame the Spirit Pearl,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.27,0:00:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,while the demonic energy\Nformed the Demon Orb.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.11,0:00:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,A Wrath of Heaven curse\Nwas cast on the Demon Orb,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.06,0:00:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,set to destroy it with\Nlightning in three years.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.36,0:01:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Later, due to Shen\NGongbao's intervening,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.06,0:01:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,the Demon Orb reincarnated as Nezha,\Nthird son of Li Jing in Chentang Pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.36,0:01:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The Spirit Pearl became Ao Bing, also\Nthe third son of the Dragon King.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.05,0:01:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,By fate,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.16,0:01:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,the two became best friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.03,0:01:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Nezha, influenced\Nby his parents,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.54,0:01:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,shed his demonic nature,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.51,0:01:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,and saved Chentang Pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.03,0:01:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Together with Ao Bing,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.28,0:01:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,they faced the Wrath of Heaven,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.50,0:01:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,and at last
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.90,0:01:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,changed their destinies.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.39,0:01:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Ne Zha 2
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.48,0:01:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Though you've\Nsurvived the wrath,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.25,0:01:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,but your bodies\Nwere destroyed...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.48,0:01:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,without which
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.31,0:02:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,the soul will soon\Nfade into oblivion.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.86,0:02:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The Sacred Lotus protects\Nand nurtures spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.15,0:02:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I will now use it to recreate
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.55,0:02:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,your physical forms.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.05,0:02:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow Stunning
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.05,0:02:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Start up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.47,0:03:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's off...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.55,0:03:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.39,0:03:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The lotus root must be powdered
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.68,0:03:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,to make your bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.76,0:03:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you just scratch\Nyour feet with that hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.30,0:03:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.64,0:03:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't mind sticky foot,\Na quick wash will fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.89,0:03:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not your foot I care.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.64,0:03:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you just blow your\Nnose with that hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.72,0:03:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,No, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.55,0:03:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just lotus powder.\NSee? Lotus powder.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.14,0:03:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.39,0:03:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.51,0:03:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,One booger for each of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.30,0:03:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean one serving.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.39,0:03:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Chop chop! To save your souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.39,0:03:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd rather...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.72,0:03:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Pain the ass, little bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.05,0:03:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It works!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.55,0:03:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.97,0:04:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.14,0:04:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.05,0:04:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been looking all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.97,0:04:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for shaping.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.39,0:04:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Flying Pig's memory\Nis unmatched,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.14,0:04:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,so is his carving skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.05,0:04:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect renovation, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.51,0:04:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Piggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.47,0:04:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move, your\Nbody's not fixed yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.18,0:04:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Immortal,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.80,0:04:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I've mobilized all\Nof Chentang's forces
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.97,0:04:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,on guarding of Shen Gongbao\Nand the Eastern Sea dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.05,0:04:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.22,0:04:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The dragons are watching\Nthe Abyss monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.84,0:04:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,none of which would escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.39,0:04:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Shen Gongbao alone is no threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.80,0:04:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You should check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.14,0:04:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't this impeccable?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.05,0:04:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Woah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.68,0:04:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He learned from the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.34,0:04:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,But,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.14,0:04:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,does it have to be\Nexactly the same?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.84,0:04:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you make me look better?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.18,0:04:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.89,0:04:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.47,0:05:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Parents always want the\Nbest for the kids, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.47,0:05:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.97,0:05:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Make me tall and hunky.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.89,0:05:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Also hauntingly handsome
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.18,0:05:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,A man must be strong and lofty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.14,0:05:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,As well as demure and mindful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.93,0:05:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But also cute and lovable.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.80,0:05:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you all make up your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.30,0:05:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Tall and hunky,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.39,0:05:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,With a touch of handsomeness.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.14,0:05:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Strong and lofty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.47,0:05:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet super adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.68,0:05:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.47,0:05:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He said... Start your\Nperformance then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.30,0:05:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.26,0:05:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I should've taken over earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.59,0:05:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,DIY is always the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.09,0:05:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This could take awhile.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.01,0:05:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do you first.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.39,0:05:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You were born of\Nthe water element,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.39,0:05:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,so you must be\Ntempered by pure water.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.09,0:06:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Open Lotus!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.73,0:06:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.09,0:06:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.00,0:06:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.67,0:06:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This version is surely\Nthe most dazzling,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.46,0:06:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,but fine-tuning will\Ntake a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.75,0:06:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,How about we just use\Nthe first one for now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.13,0:06:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, the first version will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.59,0:06:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.42,0:06:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.38,0:06:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You were born of\Nthe fire element,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.38,0:06:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,so you must be refined\Nin pure flames.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.67,0:06:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.04,0:06:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemy has been spotted at sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.29,0:06:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems to be Sheg Gongbao.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.54,0:06:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,How many?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.79,0:06:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Just him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.67,0:06:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,How come?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.50,0:06:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Carry on with your spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.67,0:06:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll handle the intruder.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.34,0:07:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Immortal,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.17,0:07:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,let me go plead with my master.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.34,0:07:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.84,0:07:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Before another incense\Nstick is fully burnt,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.63,0:07:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,your body won't be fixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.38,0:07:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Shen Gongbao,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.71,0:07:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,to what do we owe this honor?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.21,0:07:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you know of my\Nplan with the dragons,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.92,0:07:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't help but\Nfeel un... uneasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.59,0:07:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Chentang Pass is\Nheavily guarded,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.71,0:07:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,and Master Taiyi\Nis within the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.71,0:07:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You, alone, won't\Naccomplish much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.79,0:07:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Who... who said I'm alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.75,0:08:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,[Two hours ago, Dragon Palace]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.00,0:08:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If they find out about\Nthe Spirit Pearl,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.67,0:08:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,not only will you fail\Nto avenge your son,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.17,0:08:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,[Queen of Western Sea] not only\Nwill you fail to avenge your son,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.59,0:08:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,but the entire Eastern Dragon\NClan [Queen of Western Sea]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.88,0:08:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,[Dragon King of Eastern Sea] but\Nthe entire Eastern Dragon Clan
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.59,0:08:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,will bear the blame.\N[Dragon King of Eastern Sea]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.05,0:08:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,When the truth comes out,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.59,0:08:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll be cast into\Nthe abyss purgatory,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.09,0:08:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,[Dragon King of Southern Sea] you'll\Nbe cast into the abyss purgatory,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.38,0:08:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,surrounded by all your old "fellows".\N[Dragon King of Southern Sea]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.50,0:08:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see how we welcome you.\N[Dragon King of Southern Sea]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.92,0:08:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see how we welcome you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.09,0:08:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Being stuck in Dragon Palace...\N[Dragon King of Northern Sea]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.21,0:08:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you avenge your son?\N[Dragon King of Northern Sea]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.71,0:08:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you avenge your son?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.79,0:08:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Even I feel nervous for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.75,0:08:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You fools are in\Nno place to gloat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.71,0:08:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Was simply trying to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.34,0:08:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But it seems that you
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.71,0:08:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,don't appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.34,0:08:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.38,0:08:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You must've forgotten\Nwhat I'm capable of.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.84,0:09:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.96,0:09:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I know this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.13,0:09:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The Sky... Sky... Sky...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.46,0:09:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Sky Splitting Claw.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.75,0:09:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.17,0:09:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Shen can take this\Nclaw to Chentang Pass,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.71,0:09:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,and use it to tear open a\Nrift leading back to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.00,0:09:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The Abyss Monsters can then\Nhelp you destroy your enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.79,0:09:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,[Sky-Splitting Thunder Whip]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.21,0:10:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The Abyss Monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.84,0:10:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,How... is that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.50,0:10:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,They were trapped by the\NSuppression Seal for thousand years.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.79,0:10:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,How could they possibly escape?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.21,0:10:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The dragons... have they\Nalready released them?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.84,0:10:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,With the Sea-Stabilizing\NChains binding us,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.75,0:10:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,there's no chance for escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.50,0:10:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a win-win tactic.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.92,0:10:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say, my brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.84,0:10:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't be so generous.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.13,0:10:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Get to the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.92,0:10:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your price?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.09,0:10:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,In this purgatory,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.04,0:10:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,where flames burn our bodies,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.71,0:10:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,every day feels like a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.59,0:10:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,If you could slightly\Nlower the lava's heat,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.17,0:10:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,easing our suffering,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.34,0:10:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,we'd be willing to serve\Nyou with all our might.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.25,0:11:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.38,0:11:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What is Shen Gonghao up to now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.46,0:11:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, we're out! Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.17,0:11:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.50,0:11:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Vile.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.46,0:11:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We're doomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.34,0:11:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How will we explain\Nthis to General Li now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.00,0:11:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Luckily no one saw us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.54,0:11:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.59,0:11:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What for?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.34,0:11:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll break your arms
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.50,0:11:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,and then you break my legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.50,0:11:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll say the Yaksha did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.50,0:11:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.34,0:11:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,When the general sees\Nhow badly we're hurt,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.63,0:11:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,he won't blame us anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.71,0:11:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Try your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.75,0:11:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hit harder!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.50,0:11:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.00,0:11:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.04,0:11:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.84,0:11:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Immortal,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.88,0:11:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,you're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.04,0:11:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hee hee hee!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.25,0:11:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.38,0:11:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He let the Yaksha get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.92,0:11:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.75,0:12:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It was all your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.88,0:12:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you to point fingers?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.38,0:12:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you to play innocent?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.17,0:12:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.34,0:12:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Dumb and Dumber!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.75,0:12:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.88,0:12:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You two boneheads!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.63,0:12:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Get over here and guard me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.00,0:12:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Sir! Right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.59,0:13:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Show no mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.04,0:14:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Shen Gongbao!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.75,0:14:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ao Bing is not dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.13,0:14:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Chentang Pass and the dragons\Nhave no reason to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.75,0:14:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Taiyi is rebuilding Ao\NBing's body right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.00,0:14:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.84,0:14:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.79,0:14:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The shield...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.88,0:14:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.00,0:14:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.67,0:14:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Ao Bing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.67,0:15:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Taiyi has\Nbuilt me a new body.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.54,0:15:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, ceasefire.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.17,0:15:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Shen Gongbao,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.79,0:15:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I saved your disciple.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.67,0:15:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,How will you thank me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.84,0:15:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.92,0:15:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,that's Nezha in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.92,0:15:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, you ungrateful bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.29,0:15:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.96,0:15:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,They must die!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.67,0:15:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.88,0:15:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you can\Nbreak this shield?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.00,0:15:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hit me! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.38,0:15:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.75,0:16:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This aura...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.34,0:16:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ao Bing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.42,0:16:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.54,0:16:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,[Ao Guang]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.59,0:16:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.50,0:16:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I failed the mission\Nto save our kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.59,0:16:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.17,0:16:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,None of that matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.34,0:17:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want you to be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.00,0:17:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you're here,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.50,0:17:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,it's enough for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.00,0:17:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Open Lotus!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.84,0:17:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Your body, what is...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.00,0:17:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, he's\Nliterally a newborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.42,0:17:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,How could he take\Na hit like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.34,0:17:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ao Bing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.92,0:17:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! it's not ready yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.17,0:17:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move! Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.34,0:17:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Ao Bing, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.79,0:17:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Never move before\Nyour body's fixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.17,0:17:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If your body exceeds its limit,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.50,0:17:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,it will collapse!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.00,0:17:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,For heaven's sake...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.42,0:17:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Fatty!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.30,0:17:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Make another bod...\Nbody for Ao Bing, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.34,0:17:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.17,0:17:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Making two bodies back-to-back
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.50,0:17:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,has completely drained\Nthe Sacred Lotus's energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.46,0:17:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Without a body, won't\Nhis soul scatter?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.00,0:17:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Master, do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.09,0:17:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Without the Sacred Lotus,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.09,0:17:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,there's nothing I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.21,0:17:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.63,0:17:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I took your place as the\NSpirit Pearl. I deserve this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.75,0:17:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If my sacrifice
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.50,0:17:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,can bring you back to life,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.54,0:18:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,then it's a fair price to pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.50,0:18:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Who asked you to?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.63,0:18:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Am happy being the Demon Orb.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.34,0:18:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare die!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.38,0:18:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.21,0:18:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,please spare Chentang Pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.17,0:18:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We should stop the mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.29,0:18:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my final wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.84,0:18:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,There has to be other ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.04,0:18:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,There has to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.88,0:18:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You! Try harder!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.00,0:18:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Let Ao Bing share\Nyour body for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.71,0:18:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Share your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.79,0:18:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Two souls sharing one body,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.75,0:18:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,rejection is inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.38,0:18:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The Spirit Pearl and Demon\NOrb come from the same source.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.25,0:18:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Sharing one body
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.25,0:18:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,for seven days\Nshouldn't be a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.46,0:18:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.92,0:18:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Ao Bing, come on up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.00,0:18:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.67,0:18:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.42,0:18:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This feels... strange...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.42,0:18:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ao Bing, are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.59,0:18:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.67,0:18:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I can hear your\Nvoice in my head!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.00,0:19:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,This is fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.21,0:19:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is only\Na temporary fix.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.42,0:19:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What happens after seven days?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.50,0:19:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,There's some potion in the vault\Nof Yu Xu Palace, Elixir Reparo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.84,0:19:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It can restore the divine\Npower of magical items.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.96,0:19:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,With it,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.09,0:19:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,the Sacred Lotus\Nwill bloom again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.21,0:19:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But how will you obtain it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.67,0:19:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go to the Supreme Lord\Nhimself and beg for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.09,0:19:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Or are you planning to
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.29,0:19:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,report on me and the dragons?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.21,0:19:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The Supreme Lord wouldn't sa...\Nsave a son of the dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.54,0:19:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If asking doesn't work,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.88,0:19:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,then we'll just take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.25,0:19:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu Xu Palace is at the\Ncore of the Chan Sect,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.38,0:19:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,protected by formidable powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.88,0:19:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,For my son,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.09,0:19:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll break into the Court\Nof Heaven if I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.54,0:19:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.34,0:19:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I might have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.09,0:19:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Chan disciples who\Nexcel in their training
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.46,0:19:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,can participate in\Nthe Ascension Trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.29,0:19:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Passing the trial grants\Nnot only immortality,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.50,0:19:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,but also the right to choose one
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.71,0:19:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,ma... magic item from the\NYu Xu Vault as a reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.00,0:19:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you suggesting
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.67,0:19:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Nezha participate in the trial
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.96,0:19:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,to obtain the elixir?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.17,0:19:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.17,0:20:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He's beaming with\Ndemonic energy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.59,0:20:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as he uses his\Npowers, he'll be exposed!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.79,0:20:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't Ao Bing\Nsharing Nezha's body?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.46,0:20:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,His divine aura can mask the\Ndemonic energy perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.38,0:20:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as he passes the\Ntrial within seven days,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.84,0:20:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,not only will we have\Nthe el... elixir...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.79,0:20:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But he can also
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.84,0:20:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,achieve immortality.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.63,0:20:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'm not a demon anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.50,0:20:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This will save both\NAo Bing and Nezha.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.79,0:20:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Eve... everyone is happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.79,0:20:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't the\Nright thing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.17,0:20:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what do you suggest?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.34,0:20:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.34,0:20:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Come clean with the Supreme Lord
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.75,0:20:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,and trust his judgement.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.67,0:20:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,My wife and I will\Nalso plead for mercy,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.96,0:20:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,so the sins of the parents\Ndon't affect the children.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.67,0:20:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Mere mortals,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.71,0:20:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,you have only decades\Nof life experience,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.84,0:20:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,how dare you lecture\Nme about morality?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.25,0:20:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Longer than I could remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.17,0:20:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I've lived for\Nthousands of years.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.92,0:21:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you one\Ntruth and one truth only.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.21,0:21:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If my son dies,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.46,0:21:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have Chentang\NPass sink with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.17,0:21:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.09,0:21:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Ao Bing is my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.00,0:21:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I will save him for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.92,0:21:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you dare to\Nharm Chentang Pass,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.29,0:21:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll smash your Dragon Palace
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.88,0:21:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,into P.I.E.C.E.S!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.79,0:21:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Except for Nezha and Taiyi,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.92,0:21:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,no one leaves Chentang\NPass from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.50,0:21:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If in seven days I\Ndon't see Elixir Reparo,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.17,0:21:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,or the news of my clan gets out,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.96,0:21:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll let Chentang Pass
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.34,0:21:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,sink forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.92,0:21:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't trust my siblings,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.04,0:21:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,and I can't stay out\Nof my body for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.59,0:21:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The fate of Chentang Pass
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.42,0:21:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,is in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.67,0:22:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.50,0:22:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.71,0:22:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no message\Nthat can't be conveyed
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.00,0:22:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,with just a nod.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.29,0:22:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Li,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.09,0:22:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,we're all here to say goodbye\Nto Young Master Nezha.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.34,0:22:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We want to thank him for\Nsaving the entire city.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.50,0:22:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're too kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.59,0:22:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,My son has caused enough trouble
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.04,0:22:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,over the years.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.25,0:22:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Always knew the Young Master\Nwas destined for greatness.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.96,0:22:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at him,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.21,0:22:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,a wide forehead,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.63,0:22:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,broad face,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.79,0:22:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,prominent nose,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.42,0:22:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,full cheeks and thick lips.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.29,0:22:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,All signs of a true hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.79,0:22:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never been wrong\Nin reading faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.92,0:22:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Young Master, remember to\Nbrush your teeth after meals!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.25,0:22:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.88,0:22:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The Demon Slayers is now\Nre-branded as the Nezha Gang.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.96,0:22:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,All members will\Nfollow your orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.84,0:23:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Young Master, want to\Npractice calligraphy?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.63,0:23:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.55,0:23:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Young Master, you're\Nthree years old now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.59,0:23:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to get a girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.00,0:23:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Any interests in instrument?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.80,0:23:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We're proficient in all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.34,0:23:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.00,0:23:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,play shuttlecock.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.98,0:23:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.04,0:23:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.92,0:23:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.67,0:23:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll play with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.46,0:23:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you always want to\Nplay shuttlecock with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.17,0:23:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.09,0:23:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,he's a bit hard on the kicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.59,0:23:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.84,0:23:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a general of war!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.84,0:23:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.63,0:23:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.50,0:23:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,How about...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.67,0:23:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,we do it another day?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.63,0:23:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.96,0:23:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Why stop when you're having fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.21,0:23:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.79,0:23:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll join too!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.84,0:23:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,My lady, you don't\Nhave to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.34,0:23:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you looking down on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.54,0:23:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm also a general of war!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.50,0:23:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Nezha,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.30,0:23:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,catch this!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.50,0:23:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiddo,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.25,0:23:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,how did you miss that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.50,0:23:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If only weren't the Demon Orb...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.13,0:23:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.38,0:24:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.88,0:24:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.88,0:24:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Before you go,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.25,0:24:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,will you give your mother
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.71,0:24:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,a big hug?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.71,0:24:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, people are watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.00,0:24:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.34,0:24:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Here are some snacks I made.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.34,0:24:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,For you and your\Nmaster on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.84,0:24:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.79,0:24:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.38,0:24:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.00,0:24:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not on board yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.50,0:24:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Your body isn't fully fixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.84,0:24:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't use too much force.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.25,0:24:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.71,0:24:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And watch your temper.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.09,0:24:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to stay calm out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.96,0:24:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Without me and your\Nfather by your side,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.92,0:24:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,learn to take care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.42,0:24:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You silly child.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.17,0:24:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with just a hug?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.21,0:24:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That's too cringey.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.34,0:24:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not a farewell anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.21,0:24:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's move.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.59,0:25:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you sighing?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.63,0:25:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Taste bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.59,0:25:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Food, food, food.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.34,0:25:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,All you know is food.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.34,0:25:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at me,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.38,0:25:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm too worried to even eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.59,0:25:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you thought about\Nhow to pass the trial?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.88,0:25:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What is the trial about?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.79,0:25:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll test the progress\Nof your cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.17,0:25:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,In front of the judges,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.59,0:25:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,you must defeat, barehanded,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.63,0:25:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,three demon kings of\Nearth-monster level.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.29,0:25:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.17,0:25:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my specialty!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.71,0:25:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But as soon as you give\Noff demonic energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.25,0:25:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,your identity will be exposed.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.21,0:25:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let Ao Bing\Ncontrol my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.09,0:25:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,His divine energy
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.09,0:25:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,will be just as powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.92,0:25:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.79,0:25:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's try.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.84,0:25:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Nezha,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.59,0:25:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,fully relax your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.42,0:25:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Let Ao Bing take\Ncontrol and fight me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.79,0:25:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Ao Bing, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.29,0:25:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep steady!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.25,0:25:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,When a soul inhabits\Nanother body,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.96,0:25:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,unless your willpower is much\Nstronger than the host's,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.13,0:25:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,you won't be able\Nto fully control it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.59,0:25:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Nezha, step back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.75,0:26:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The harder you push,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.29,0:26:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,the less Ao Bing can control.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.96,0:26:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Use your leg!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.00,0:26:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweep him, sweep him!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.25,0:26:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't panic!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.80,0:26:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.67,0:26:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.67,0:26:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Having fun, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.25,0:26:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We're almost at Yu Xu Palace,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.50,0:26:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,and you're still messing around.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.75,0:26:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.67,0:26:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,what kind of mentor are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.00,0:26:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand here and reflect\Non your mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.50,0:26:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No meals until\Nyou figure it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.34,0:26:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a grown man.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.46,0:26:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop acting like a\Nreckless teenager.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.00,0:26:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.71,0:26:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The Sleepy-Slumber Pill.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.71,0:26:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.96,0:26:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this, and you'll\Nfall asleep immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.13,0:26:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you're asleep,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.00,0:26:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Ao Bing can fully\Ncontrol your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.84,0:26:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Brilliant!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.46,0:26:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,One is enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.67,0:26:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Should've told me...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.34,0:26:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.00,0:27:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.25,0:27:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Taiyi?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.00,0:27:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Now this feels\Nlike the real deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.92,0:27:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.17,0:27:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.42,0:27:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I see you've completely\Ntaken over Nezha's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.75,0:27:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go again.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.46,0:27:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,This time, I won't hold back.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.17,0:27:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd better give\Nit your all, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.50,0:27:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I humbly seek your guidance.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.04,0:27:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.79,0:27:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Barely able to match my skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.59,0:27:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Taiyi,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.25,0:27:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,your nose is bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.71,0:27:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Too heaty recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.63,0:27:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Need more water.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.55,0:27:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,No big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.50,0:28:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Kunlun Mountain! We're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.42,0:28:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard a day here
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.50,0:28:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,equals a year in\Nthe mortal world.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.88,0:28:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.75,0:28:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not in the\Ncelestial realm yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.17,0:28:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But this many people?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.17,0:28:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,They've all come to\Nseek immortality.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.79,0:28:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Chan sect is famous\Nacross the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.67,0:28:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,and everyone wants to join.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.88,0:28:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.88,0:28:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The jasper.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.00,0:28:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a credential of\Na Chan Sect immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.75,0:28:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,With it,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.75,0:28:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll receive respect\Neverywhere you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.00,0:28:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.75,0:28:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Being an immortal is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.63,0:28:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Both of your brothers\Nhave ascended.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.88,0:28:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll have no problem either.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.04,0:28:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean Nezha's brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.92,0:28:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,His two brothers
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.00,0:28:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,are among the best of the\Nthird generation disciples.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.54,0:28:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.55,0:28:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,how Nezha always\Nmisbehaves, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.00,0:28:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I often tell stories\Nabout his brothers
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.09,0:28:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,to set a good example for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.75,0:28:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you something,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.00,0:28:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Nezha idolizes his brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.50,0:29:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh wow, you're lucky
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.75,0:29:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,to meet the well-known\NDemon Hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.09,0:29:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Demon Hunters?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.42,0:29:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,They roam the land, hunting down
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.96,0:29:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,demons that wreak\Nhavoc on humanity,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.42,0:29:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,keeping the world at peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.17,0:29:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The current leader\Nof the Demon Hunters
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.00,0:29:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,is the top disciple\Nof Immortal Wuliang.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.42,0:29:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't his predecessor\NShen Gongbao?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.96,0:29:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,[Yu Xu Palace]
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.71,0:29:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Taiyi,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.46,0:29:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,what's that smoke over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.92,0:29:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.71,0:29:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the most precious\Ntreasure of Yu Xu Palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.09,0:29:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Tianyuan Cauldron.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.54,0:29:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Taiyi.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.88,0:29:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,[Immortal Wuliang]\NBrother Taiyi.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.50,0:29:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been forever.\N[Immortal Wuliang]
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.54,0:29:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,[Immortal Wuliang]
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.34,0:29:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Wuliang!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.67,0:29:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard that during\NMaster's seclusion,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.34,0:29:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,you've been in charge\Nof Yu Xu Palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.04,0:30:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I've brought my disciple to\Nparticipate in the Ascension Trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.59,0:30:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Nezha,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.17,0:30:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Pay respect to Master Wuliang.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.00,0:30:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Wuliang.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.17,0:30:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you're Nezha?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.67,0:30:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The reincarnation\Nof the Spirit Pearl?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.71,0:30:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.34,0:30:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,How remarkable!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.04,0:30:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The Supreme Lord holds\Ngreat expectations for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.34,0:30:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And you sure don't disappoint.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.71,0:30:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.88,0:30:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,So full of robust vitality,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.09,0:30:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,giving off a righteous vibe.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.09,0:30:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The boy's been over\Ntraining lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.29,0:30:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,His state is a bit unstable.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.96,0:30:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.59,0:30:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Yu Xu Palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.04,0:30:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to pee!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.50,0:30:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Crana!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.75,0:30:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.46,0:30:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Take the child to\Nthe restroom. [Crana]
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.00,0:30:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Restroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.96,0:30:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't say anything\Nabout resting.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.21,0:30:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.92,0:30:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Restroom
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.88,0:30:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,is where you pee.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.34,0:30:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The boy's a bit rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.88,0:30:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Please forgive him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.54,0:31:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.55,0:31:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,So white!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.17,0:31:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.71,0:31:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,So white!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.29,0:31:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.09,0:31:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,So white!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.96,0:31:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the entire\Npalace made of jade?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.13,0:31:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did they get so\Nmuch money to buy jade?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.17,0:31:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The "Yu" in Yu Xu Palace\Nmeans jade, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.50,0:31:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what does the "Xu" mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.17,0:31:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Humble?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.09,0:31:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Guilty?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.96,0:31:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Or emptiness?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.13,0:31:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the restroom\Nalso made of jade?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.67,0:31:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Even immortals need to pee?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.67,0:31:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Does Immortal Wuliang also poop?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.34,0:31:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a place of cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.46,0:31:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Lower your voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.50,0:31:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,How much further is the toilet?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.96,0:31:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't hold it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.88,0:31:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, sister, wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.71,0:31:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.04,0:31:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.29,0:31:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to change my skirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.30,0:31:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Go by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.42,0:31:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't know\Nwhere the toilet is.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.04,0:31:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Go through the corridor,\Nturn right, then left.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.04,0:31:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.04,0:32:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.42,0:32:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,How fancy it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.21,0:32:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Radical!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.46,0:32:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.50,0:32:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.96,0:32:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.46,0:32:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.96,0:32:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I got lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.92,0:32:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.46,0:32:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, good job\Nraising the Spirit Pearl.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.17,0:32:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Another great\Nachievement for the Sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.96,0:32:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.75,0:32:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all thanks to\NMaster's guidance.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.96,0:33:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,This Kunlun Dew\Nis a rare elixir.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.34,0:33:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Normally, it takes six\Nmonths to fill a basin.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.13,0:33:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But today, when I\Nsent someone to check,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.84,0:33:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,it's already full!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.34,0:33:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Your timing couldn't be better.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.88,0:33:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.34,0:33:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,luck sure favors\Nyou, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.75,0:33:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.71,0:33:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't even drink water properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.42,0:33:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,My disciple is a bit crude.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.04,0:33:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Please forgive him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.42,0:33:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,My pee is in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.54,0:33:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,My master is a bit crude, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.09,0:33:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Please forgive him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.67,0:33:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.34,0:33:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,time is of the essence.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.42,0:33:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I think Nezha should go\Nthrough the trial immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.92,0:33:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the rush?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.25,0:33:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's have a few\Nmore drinks first.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.25,0:33:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.29,0:33:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.67,0:33:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,My disciple Deero\Nwill be the judge.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.63,0:33:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The next target of\Nthe Demon Hunters
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.13,0:33:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,can be captured by Nezha.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.09,0:33:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, excuse us.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.17,0:33:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Taiyi, my brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.38,0:34:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,always so impatient.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.17,0:34:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The taste of the Dew this year
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.67,0:34:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,is especially rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.00,0:34:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep using this\Nmethod in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.84,0:34:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, master.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.38,0:35:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Why stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.67,0:35:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been six hours,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.84,0:35:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Shen.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.71,0:35:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Too tired to continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.88,0:35:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Rubbish!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.46,0:35:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Cultivation allows no laziness.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.59,0:35:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Without my permission
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.13,0:35:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll never stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.38,0:35:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,General Li Jing of Chentang\NPass is here to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.34,0:35:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Shen,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.50,0:35:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,yesterday's battle
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.50,0:35:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,left many soldiers and civilians\Nof Chentang Pass injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.79,0:35:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We've run out of medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.84,0:35:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Humbly ask you to open a path
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.38,0:35:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,so that a few doctors can\Nleave the city to buy supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.88,0:35:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,How bold!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.34,0:35:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No wonder you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.84,0:35:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Who did that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.25,0:35:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You son of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.71,0:35:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.04,0:35:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,St... stop, stop, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.25,0:35:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring me the one
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.17,0:35:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,you caught earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.84,0:35:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,He escaped the city\Nduring the battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.59,0:35:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,General Li, please,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.17,0:36:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,take him ba... back with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.54,0:36:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a misunderstanding,\NMaster Shen!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.34,0:36:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a demon too!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.67,0:36:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I captured this Yaksha
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.34,0:36:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,to clear my son's name.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.75,0:36:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that it's settled,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.17,0:36:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,and since he hasn't\Ndone anything worse,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.67,0:36:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,just let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.38,0:36:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.25,0:36:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just a small role.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.38,0:36:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Insignificant.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.92,0:36:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think you understood me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.96,0:36:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No one leaves here,\Nnot even a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.50,0:36:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Let alone humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.71,0:36:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Shen, please have mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.42,0:36:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a demon, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.92,0:36:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We are both villains!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.92,0:36:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Pfft!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.55,0:36:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm n... not a villain.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.29,0:36:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone who knows the\Nsecret of the Spirit Pearl
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.21,0:36:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,must stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.17,0:36:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Without medicine,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.59,0:36:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,the injured won't survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.34,0:36:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Shen, please,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.96,0:36:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm only asking to save lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.63,0:36:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.00,0:36:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,We caught a spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.21,0:36:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This creature came\Nfrom outside the city,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.63,0:36:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,and injured some\Nof our soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.13,0:36:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Lock... lock him up too.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.67,0:36:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.09,0:36:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.63,0:37:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.96,0:37:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, it's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.46,0:37:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,[Shen Xiaobao]
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.84,0:37:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaobao?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.42,0:37:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't been\Nhome for centuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.13,0:37:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I miss you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.04,0:37:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.38,0:37:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Father sent me to find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.75,0:37:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.67,0:37:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,the compass you gave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.71,0:37:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It tells me where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.54,0:37:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.79,0:37:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,how is he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.79,0:37:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.67,0:37:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since you\Nentered Yu Xu Palace,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.46,0:37:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,father's been full of energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.21,0:37:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,like he took some miracle tonic.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.71,0:37:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You are the only one\Nfrom our village ever
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.42,0:37:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,to make it as a\NChan Sect immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.34,0:37:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, fellow demons\Nfrom miles around
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.63,0:37:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,are pouring in to\Ntrain with father.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.46,0:37:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.04,0:37:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.54,0:37:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you promise me before,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.96,0:37:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,once I've achieved human form,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.29,0:37:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,you'd get me into Yu Xu Palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.34,0:37:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Look! can turn into a human now!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.38,0:37:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,All these years,\NI've trained so hard,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.09,0:37:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,and never slacked off.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.09,0:38:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You're my role\Nmodel, big brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.75,0:38:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Glory to Yu Xu,\Nanswering heaven's call.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.09,0:38:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Travel the world,\Nbringing justice to all.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.50,0:38:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.67,0:38:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.63,0:38:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.50,0:38:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Are these sea monsters\Nyour subordinates?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.34,0:38:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you surrounding\NChentang Pass?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.34,0:38:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, about that...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.42,0:38:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Th... this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.50,0:38:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Shen is\Ndefending Chentang Pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.17,0:38:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.50,0:38:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Evil forces invaded the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.13,0:38:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Shen and the sea\Nclan came to our aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.67,0:38:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,On behalf of my people,\Nthank you for this noble act.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.34,0:38:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mention it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.54,0:38:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.17,0:38:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, you're incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.34,0:38:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this the demon\Nattacking Chentang Pass?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.38,0:38:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.96,0:38:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You are a disgrace\Nto all demons!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.17,0:38:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Shame on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.96,0:38:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.84,0:38:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaobao,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.21,0:38:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,can you
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.50,0:38:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,wait a few more years
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.04,0:38:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,before going to Yu Xu Palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.54,0:38:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.38,0:38:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.71,0:39:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I can transform\Ninto a human now!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.13,0:39:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just that...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.59,0:39:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm preparing for my promotion\Nto the Twelve Golden Immortals,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.46,0:39:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,so I can't be distracted.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.50,0:39:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Twelve Golden Immortals?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.09,0:39:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Once it's done,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.88,0:39:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take you there,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.46,0:39:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.71,0:39:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No problem, brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.55,0:39:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Your promotion is\Nmore important.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.88,0:39:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Can go to Yu Xu Palace anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.00,0:39:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.71,0:39:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,haven't quite mastered\Nthe shape-shifting.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.92,0:39:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go back and practice more.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.67,0:39:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Practice more.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.13,0:39:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaobao,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.50,0:39:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,this is what I saved up\Nsince entering the Palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.50,0:39:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.75,0:39:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu Xu Palace gives all disciples\Nthese immortality pills.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.75,0:39:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Take one
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.67,0:39:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,and you ga... gain ten\Nyears' worth of cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.79,0:39:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.88,0:39:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,this is too precious.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.13,0:39:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, you're training\Nfor a promotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.84,0:39:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You should keep them.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.34,0:39:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like how it tastes.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.67,0:39:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I prefer cultivating my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.67,0:39:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You... you bring them back.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.88,0:39:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Share with the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.25,0:39:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.80,0:39:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Father will blame me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.00,0:39:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaobao,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.80,0:39:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,are you not obeying\Nyour big brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.38,0:40:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Take the pills and leave now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.67,0:40:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the front line.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.29,0:40:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If... if you stay,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.54,0:40:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be distracted.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.17,0:40:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.71,0:40:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.50,0:40:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.50,0:40:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.46,0:40:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You must make it into the\NTwelve Golden Immortals.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.67,0:40:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep training myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.88,0:40:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I appreciate your help,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.42,0:40:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,but the stake is too high
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.63,0:40:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,for me to let anyone through.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.17,0:40:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,This Yaksha...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.21,0:40:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,you... you bring him back, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.09,0:40:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't helping you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.46,0:40:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I was helping the young one.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.67,0:40:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,A good role model
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.75,0:40:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,can change his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.79,0:40:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.96,0:40:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Le... leave me a list\Nof medicines you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.13,0:40:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,[Level 1 Bandits Hill]
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.09,0:41:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Am Nezha, the Third Prince bold.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.09,0:41:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I slay the demons, I\Nwrite in rhyme untold.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.00,0:41:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Today I come to rid\Nthe evil's breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.88,0:41:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You wicked fiends,\Nprepare for death!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.63,0:41:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Still eating?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.59,0:41:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You are doomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.09,0:41:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.63,0:41:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Who do you think you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.04,0:42:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Barging into our Bandits Hill?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.21,0:42:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're in charge?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.21,0:42:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Come forward
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.96,0:42:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,and have a taste of my power.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.42,0:42:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You arrogant spoilt brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.29,0:42:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.09,0:42:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,teach him a lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.25,0:42:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Show me what got.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.34,0:42:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You go.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.54,0:42:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,No, but, boss...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.46,0:42:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,how dare I steal your thunder?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.50,0:42:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting a child is\Njust embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.79,0:42:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,When I say go, you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.88,0:42:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, k-k-kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.21,0:42:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you're young and naive,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.92,0:42:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm willing to let this slide.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.38,0:42:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.75,0:42:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's still not too late\Nto run home to mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.63,0:42:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.25,0:42:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you awake again?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.34,0:42:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.00,0:42:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a light sleeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.00,0:42:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,All that shaking\Nhas jolted me awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.46,0:42:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.46,0:42:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,He took too much of that pill
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.84,0:42:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,and now he's immune.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.09,0:43:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Increase the dose then.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.34,0:43:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,If you insist to stay,\Nyou might get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.00,0:43:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I was going to\Ndodge to the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.34,0:43:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I thought it was left.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.50,0:43:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,So weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.92,0:43:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Taiyi.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.63,0:43:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should cut in.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.96,0:43:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He could use a few\Nmore years' training.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.34,0:43:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.50,0:43:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He was just teasing the demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.54,0:43:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The boy likes to...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.46,0:43:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,play dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.34,0:43:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Pills.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.34,0:43:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I need pills.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.17,0:43:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I gave you a warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.50,0:43:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you know who\Nyou're messing with.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.21,0:43:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.67,0:43:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The pills have\Ndissolved in the soup!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.00,0:43:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll drink the soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.04,0:43:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're trying\Nto steal our soup?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.92,0:43:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This calls for a beating.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.17,0:43:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.92,0:43:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Super Mighty Club Strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.79,0:43:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,See!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.50,0:43:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you he was pretending.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.46,0:44:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't paying attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.34,0:44:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Not possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.29,0:44:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Not possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.88,0:44:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You suck!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.75,0:44:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Step aside!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.84,0:44:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch me kick his butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.50,0:44:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you spit it all out?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.67,0:44:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The taste is too strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.79,0:44:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.71,0:44:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Check this out!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.42,0:44:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.84,0:44:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't working.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.67,0:44:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't win without the pill.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.84,0:44:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Deero is watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.96,0:44:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't give you the pill.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.38,0:44:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.67,0:44:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.17,0:45:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,There is another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.67,0:45:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not suggesting...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.84,0:45:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We can eat the puke.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.00,0:45:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.67,0:45:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,it's disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.17,0:45:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the big deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.09,0:45:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I've drank Yaksha booger before.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.79,0:45:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,This explains a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.34,0:45:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,No pain,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.04,0:45:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,no gain.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.13,0:45:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how Nezha defeat fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.67,0:45:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The lives of my parents\Nand friends are at stake,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.67,0:45:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,and the people of\NChentang Pass too.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.34,0:45:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This is E-A-S-Y P-E-A-S-Y!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.29,0:45:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,With ignoring prejudice,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.50,0:45:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,and overcoming inner fears,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.67,0:45:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I will change my destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.50,0:46:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I've kept low-key
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.75,0:46:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,until today's show.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.17,0:46:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Taiyi...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.42,0:46:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll save Nezha first.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.71,0:46:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we'll figure out a\Nway for Elixir Reparo.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.50,0:46:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.96,0:46:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.21,0:46:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.92,0:46:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,let's go another round.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.75,0:46:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Fake death?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.79,0:46:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'I smash you!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.84,0:46:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Good thing Nezha\Ngot knocked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.21,0:46:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You do suck!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.42,0:46:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me avenge you!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.92,0:46:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Invincible Whirlwind Punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.92,0:46:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.59,0:47:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Do we have to catch them all?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.67,0:47:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Even leaving one behind
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.88,0:47:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,could harm the people here.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.67,0:47:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Take them all back\Nto Yu Xu Palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.00,0:47:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The Sect will guide\Nthem to the right path,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.00,0:47:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,turning evil to good.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.13,0:47:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Your face...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.46,0:47:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No biggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.50,0:47:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He's sometimes ugly,\Nsometimes handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.34,0:47:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Spirit Pearl, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.17,0:47:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,not like normal people.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.00,0:47:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Be more careful next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.67,0:47:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You scared my soul out.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.27,0:47:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's this kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.19,0:47:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Nezha, possibly.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.31,0:47:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinzha and Muzha's\Nyounger brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.44,0:47:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the Spirit Pearl reincarnation\Nappointed by the Supreme Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.85,0:48:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,But his looks aren't much, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.35,0:48:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hunched back.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.98,0:48:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Wobbly pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.23,0:48:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Sinking brows and drooping eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.48,0:48:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Rude face.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.52,0:48:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to mention the\Ndark eye circles.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.69,0:48:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He's like a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.56,0:48:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't stir up trouble now.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.10,0:48:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.48,0:48:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,what's the star sign tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.31,0:48:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Six stars in alignment,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.02,0:48:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,once in a decade.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.73,0:48:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Whenever six stars align,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.73,0:48:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,this Jade Podium can transmit sound\Nand images across thousands of miles.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.94,0:48:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Our brothers scatter\Nall over the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.14,0:48:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And finally get together.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.10,0:48:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight is the night,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.35,0:48:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,the Golden Immortals shall meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.73,0:48:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't ascended\Nto the Twelve yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.52,0:48:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I shouldn't be included.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.31,0:48:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.35,0:48:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,No la, no la.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.44,0:48:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not appropriate at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.56,0:49:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do it, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.14,0:49:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why are you\Nsitting up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.52,0:49:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.19,0:49:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Would it kill you to\Nsee your master thrive?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.27,0:49:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,A sauna!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.77,0:49:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.77,0:49:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Brothers and sisters, I humbly\Nwelcome you back to your places.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.60,0:49:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Greetings, Brother Wuliang!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.06,0:49:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to introduce\Na new member.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.94,0:49:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Taiyi.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.77,0:49:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,He has fulfilled the\Nmaster's expectations.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.31,0:49:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And successfully nurtured
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.10,0:49:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,the Spirit Pearl reincarnation.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.77,0:49:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Pay your respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.69,0:49:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The Deification War is imminent.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.94,0:49:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We are here to discuss\Nthe preparation.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.69,0:49:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Chan Sect is the orthodox of\NTao, [Immortal Guangcheng]
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.10,0:49:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,so we're destined to win.\N[Immortal Guangcheng]
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.02,0:49:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,So we're destined to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.77,0:49:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,But as Jie Sect has risen rapidly\Nthese years, [Immortal Chijing]
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.94,0:50:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,we must remain vigilant.\N[Immortal Chijing]
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.64,0:50:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,[Immortal Ju Liu Sun]
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.52,0:50:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Jie sect, [Immortal Ju Liu Sun]
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.27,0:50:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,is where furry and horny beasts\Ngather [Immortal Ju Liu Sun]
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.89,0:50:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,is where furry and\Nhorny beasts gather
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.52,0:50:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,and creatures born\Nof mucus and eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.35,0:50:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,This war concerns the\Nsurvival of our sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.31,0:50:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We must be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.85,0:50:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,[Immortal Huanglong]\NWe must be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.06,0:50:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Strengthening our power\N[Immortal Huanglong]
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.94,0:50:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,is the key. [Immortal Huanglong]
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.15,0:50:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.23,0:50:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Precisely,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.98,0:50:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I began\Npreparing early.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.27,0:50:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Immortality pills,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.44,0:50:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,a total of nine thousand,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.27,0:50:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,could be allocated\Naccording to grades.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.10,0:50:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,This will definitely\Nboost our strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.89,0:50:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,How are there so many?\N[Immortal Daoheng]
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.02,0:50:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,How are there so many?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.06,0:50:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,For a hundred years,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.23,0:50:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,our master has tirelessly refined\Npills with the Tianyuan Cauldron,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.98,0:50:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,working day and night,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.52,0:50:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,at the cost of his\Nown cultivating.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.44,0:50:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Wuliang has dedicated himself\Nto building our sect, [Immortal Lingbao]
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.23,0:50:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,his contributions\Nare to be praised.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.81,0:50:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Aye, aye.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.94,0:50:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides the Jie Sect,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.27,0:50:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,[Immortal Cihang]\NBesides the Jie Sect,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.48,0:50:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,are there other evil forces plotting\Nagainst us? [Immortal Cihang]
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.69,0:50:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Are there other evil\Nforces plotting against us?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.81,0:50:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Cihang,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.89,0:50:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,as soon as menacing\Ndemons are discovered,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.60,0:50:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,the Demon Hunters will\Nimmediately be sent out.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.23,0:50:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So, most stray demons\Npost no threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.02,0:50:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.77,0:51:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,there is one exception.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.39,0:51:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? [Immortal Yuding]
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.31,0:51:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is that? [Immortal Yuding]
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.77,0:51:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The Eastern Sea dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.56,0:51:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragons?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.23,0:51:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't they surrender to the Court\Nof Heaven long ago? [Immortal Qingxu]
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.52,0:51:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,No kind could be trusted\Nexcept for our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.52,0:51:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,To me,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.60,0:51:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,their surrender is\Nmerely a facade,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.14,0:51:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,hibernating for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.19,0:51:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The dragons have helped subdue the\Nabyss monsters for thousands of years.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.39,0:51:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What's their crime?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.06,0:51:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,But they own great strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.94,0:51:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If they betray us in the war,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.60,0:51:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,the whole situation\Ncould be overturned.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.94,0:51:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But we still can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.27,0:51:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Our reputation of righteousness\Nand justness is known to all.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.64,0:51:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,[Immortal Wenshu] Our reputation of\Nrighteousness and justness is known to all.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.60,0:51:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If we gratuitously\N[Immortal Wenshu]
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.10,0:51:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,attack the surrendered,\N[Immortal Wenshu]
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.94,0:51:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,attack the surrendered,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.94,0:51:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How will anyone ever trust us?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.10,0:51:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Aye.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.77,0:51:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We must not act rashly.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.35,0:51:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Further deliberation\Nis necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.39,0:51:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.94,0:51:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.27,0:51:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,They made their points.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.94,0:51:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And you don't have\Nto be bigoted.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.94,0:51:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.10,0:51:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The time of the six-star\Nalignment is almost over.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.56,0:51:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Since there are no other topics,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.73,0:52:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,let's adjourn the meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.02,0:52:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.10,0:52:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinzha and Muzha,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.10,0:52:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,are disciples of myself\Nand Brother Puxian.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.02,0:52:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,They have been cultivating here\Nfor many years away from home,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.10,0:52:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,and have never even met Nezha,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.69,0:52:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,their younger brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.19,0:52:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,[Immortal Puxian] Since there's still\Ntime left in the six-star alignment,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.06,0:52:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,why not let them\N[Immortal Puxian]
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.98,0:52:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,why not let them
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.48,0:52:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,meet for awhile?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.06,0:52:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.02,0:52:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,OMG!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.27,0:52:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.44,0:52:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.52,0:52:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,. Speaking of my look...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.81,0:52:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Will my first impression...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.44,0:52:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,be bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.14,0:52:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.19,0:52:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.90,0:52:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Though slovenly,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.98,0:52:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,you've got strong will.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.98,0:52:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Though short,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.81,0:52:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,you've got a big heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.02,0:52:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Though ugly,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.10,0:52:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,you're kind inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.14,0:52:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Though you have\Nblack eye circles,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.10,0:52:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,a piggy nose,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.77,0:52:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,and a missing tooth,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.60,0:52:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I still think
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.27,0:52:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,you're truly incredibly great.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.27,0:52:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm sure your\Nbrothers would agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.73,0:52:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the compliment.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.89,0:53:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.56,0:53:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You go meet my brothers for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.77,0:53:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.19,0:53:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I do this for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.27,0:53:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Nezha.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.31,0:53:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Nezha!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.69,0:53:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The boy is a bit shy.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.89,0:53:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Nezha!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.27,0:53:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.52,0:53:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Ao Bing,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.85,0:53:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,you cried?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.73,0:53:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This reminded me\Nof my two brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.94,0:53:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You have brothers too?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.77,0:53:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.89,0:53:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I used to.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.23,0:54:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Having two such\Nwonderful brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.19,0:54:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.39,0:54:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What were you talking\Nabout just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.44,0:54:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,They said
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.94,0:54:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,they're sorry for not checking\Non you all these years.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.94,0:54:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,They asked
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.94,0:54:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,how things have been at home,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.60,0:54:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,if your parents are well,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.77,0:54:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,what hobbies you have,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.77,0:54:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,and who your friends are.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.60,0:54:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,They also said
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.10,0:54:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,whatever problems you may have in\Nthe future, you must tell them.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.39,0:54:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And remember, you\Nhave two brothers
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.77,0:54:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,who will always, always\Nhelp and protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.56,0:54:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.19,0:54:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.02,0:54:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just eyes in my sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.94,0:54:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure it's not\Nthe other way around?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.73,0:54:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Annoying!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.27,0:54:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I already said it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.94,0:54:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,OK. You are the boss here.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.64,0:54:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.40,0:54:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine fine,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.77,0:54:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll stop laughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.81,0:54:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you still mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.10,0:54:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Nezha?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.98,0:54:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Nezha!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.60,0:54:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Ao Bing,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.85,0:55:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been violent and\Nunruly since I was young,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.10,0:55:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,making my parents worry all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.19,0:55:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Your father,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.39,0:55:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,though he attacked\NChentang Pass,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.27,0:55:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I know he only risked everything
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.77,0:55:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,for your sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.94,0:55:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And today,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.39,0:55:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,my brothers were so kind to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.81,0:55:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Our families have\Nsacrificed so much for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.35,0:55:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a monster,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.44,0:55:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'm a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.77,0:55:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We're both burdens\Nfor our families.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.94,0:55:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So what if we were\Nborn as demons?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.56,0:55:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Immortal or demon,\NI make the choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.48,0:55:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you're saved,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.27,0:55:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,we must win ourselves a\Nplace among the immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.94,0:55:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,so our families won't\Nhave to worry anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.27,0:55:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.10,0:55:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Only by becoming immortals,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.10,0:55:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,can we have everyone's respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.60,0:55:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.98,0:55:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to become an immortal!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.89,0:55:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Only with courage and diligence\Ncan great progress be made.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.60,0:55:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,[Level 2 Ascension Falls] Only with courage\Nand diligence can great progress be made.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.77,0:55:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,At this speed, cultivating\N[Level 2 Ascension Falls]
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.94,0:55:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,At this speed, cultivating
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.35,0:55:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,a hundred more years\Nwould still be in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.52,0:55:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,About cultivating,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.19,0:56:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,the priorities are vitality,\Nenergy, and spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.77,0:56:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,If you feel it's difficult,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.85,0:56:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,or you feel exhausted,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.89,0:56:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,it's because you\Nwere born demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.14,0:56:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Only by giving it your all
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.64,0:56:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,will you have a chance\Nto change your destiny
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.89,0:56:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,and achieve immortality.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.35,0:56:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Life or death, of\Nnone I'm scared,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.35,0:56:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,defying authority is\Nwhat I've revered.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.35,0:56:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,My fate is mine,\Nnot heaven's plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.35,0:56:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,This bad boy will\Nbecome a godly man!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.44,0:56:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Bravo!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.94,0:56:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a few lines,\Nyet so powerful,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.39,0:56:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,truly inspiring.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.89,0:56:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,A great poem, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.89,0:56:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,This is something all of\Nyou should learn from.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.94,0:56:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.73,0:56:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it that good?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.27,0:56:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I just made it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.39,0:56:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.56,0:56:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Every word counts,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.48,0:56:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,and it's inspiring.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.60,0:56:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,A poem like this
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.35,0:56:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,shows the ambition\Nof you, young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.89,0:56:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,A true young hero
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.35,0:56:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,with a bright future ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.77,0:56:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on. It's just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.39,0:56:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, it still\Nhas some tiny flaws.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.06,0:57:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,More like plenty of flaws.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.44,0:57:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me ask you,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.10,0:57:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,what's with those\Ndark eye circles?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.73,0:57:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's obvious you stay\Nup late all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.94,0:57:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Your life is undisciplined,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.10,0:57:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,your diet unhealthy,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.14,0:57:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,and you can't even manage\Nbasic self-control.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.98,0:57:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you dream of\Nbecoming an immortal?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.06,0:57:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I was born with\Ndark eye circles.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.44,0:57:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Appearance reflects the\Nheart, don't you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.10,0:57:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a look at\Nyourself in the mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.35,0:57:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Ridiculous, reckless and sloppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.90,0:57:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,If you were my disciple, I'd\Nmake you rebuild your human form.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.77,0:57:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Can be rebuilt?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.19,0:57:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Then there's hope\Nfor my looks, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.94,0:57:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Teach me, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.90,0:57:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Knew you came to find\Nyourself a master.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.69,0:57:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.60,0:57:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I see you have great ambition,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.44,0:57:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,so I'll take you as my disciple.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.02,0:57:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.60,0:57:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.98,0:57:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Come,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.56,0:57:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,train with your brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.77,0:57:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Train for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.48,0:57:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Immortality, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.27,0:57:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need you\Nto teach me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.52,0:57:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Teach me how to be prettier.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.39,0:57:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.27,0:57:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You're putting looks\Nbefore cultivation?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.27,0:57:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Get your priorities straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.56,0:57:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you teaching me or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.06,0:57:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We're no longer\Nmaster and disciple.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.19,0:57:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You deserve to have\Npanda eyes for life.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.14,0:57:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That's too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.15,0:57:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I was going to go easy on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.89,0:57:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.31,0:57:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you challenging me?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.44,0:57:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Three pills should be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.69,0:57:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.35,0:57:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,go back where you came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.27,0:57:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,If you keep\Ndisrupting our class,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.31,0:58:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,this could end badly for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.52,0:58:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.77,0:58:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You're no match for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.64,0:58:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Impressive, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.81,0:58:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I underestimated you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.85,0:59:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Try this!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.31,0:59:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, teach this\Nignorant brat a lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.35,0:59:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Master will surely win!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.60,0:59:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,So fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.02,0:59:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You saw it?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.23,0:59:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We have no grudges between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.23,0:59:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd better go.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.98,0:59:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.19,0:59:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't even touch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.06,0:59:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Let alone fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.56,0:59:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Smart move!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.23,0:59:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold him tight, render\Nhis speed useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.39,0:59:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Surrender?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.94,1:00:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you are...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.35,1:00:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally figured it out?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.52,1:00:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not that I'm fast,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.27,1:00:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I just transform into\Nelectric currents,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.06,1:00:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,traveling instantly\Nto any location.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.27,1:00:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,In water,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.44,1:00:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I am invincible!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.60,1:00:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Impressive cryo power.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.60,1:00:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.85,1:00:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Go too hard and your\Nbody will collapse!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.94,1:00:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ice doesn't conduct electricity.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.44,1:00:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see what else you've got.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.27,1:00:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Lakes and seas. Clouds and sky.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.06,1:00:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,By this divine talisman in my hand.\NWind is to rise and rain is to fall.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.98,1:00:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Swift and Uplift!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.48,1:01:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.98,1:01:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.81,1:01:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The Rain Summoning Spell.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.94,1:01:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,End this now!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.77,1:01:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Too late.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.31,1:01:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You're doomed.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.19,1:02:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.52,1:02:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Master, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.02,1:02:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't going to\Ntake your life.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.31,1:02:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't have to\Nsacrifice an arm.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.81,1:02:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,All disciples, listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.39,1:02:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Take the demons\Nback to the palace.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.56,1:02:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.27,1:02:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.02,1:02:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Put them down.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.81,1:02:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,All of you, put them down!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.23,1:02:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,May I ask if you are a\Nmember of the Chan Sect?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.48,1:02:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That's correct.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.27,1:02:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.77,1:02:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,These are all immortals\Nfrom Yu Xu Palace.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.52,1:02:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You must not be disrespectful.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.52,1:02:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Entering Yu Xu Palace
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.81,1:02:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,and receiving the teachings\Nof the righteous path
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.06,1:02:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,may not be a bad thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.98,1:02:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,All of you, drop your weapons!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.10,1:02:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.31,1:02:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaobao?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.27,1:02:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,How come you're back?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.31,1:03:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaobao,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.27,1:03:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,stand down!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.44,1:03:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaobao!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.31,1:03:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Impudent!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.56,1:03:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you hurt\Nour Sect members?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.06,1:03:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.31,1:03:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.27,1:03:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Nezha,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.90,1:03:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,freeze the river now!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.10,1:04:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't escape!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.56,1:04:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.64,1:04:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.98,1:04:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Go now!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.89,1:04:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.89,1:04:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Father...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.14,1:04:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no escape.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.98,1:04:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Step aside.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.98,1:04:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just trying\Nto save his father.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.44,1:04:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't have to be so brutal.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.37,1:04:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.87,1:04:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Panax notoginseng,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.91,1:04:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,cattail pollen,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.70,1:04:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,munjeet,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.66,1:04:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,borneol,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.16,1:05:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,dragon's blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.33,1:05:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,One more basket.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.12,1:05:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Safflower,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.54,1:05:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,angelica,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.20,1:05:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,pseudo-ginseng powder,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.04,1:05:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,sappanwood,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.54,1:05:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,poison nut.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.37,1:05:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.24,1:05:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,we now have everything\Non the list,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.54,1:05:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,along with a hundred extra\Nbaskets of sea products.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.20,1:05:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We happen to be short on\Nfood supplies in the city.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.24,1:05:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Shen, a moment, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.74,1:05:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,We've prepared a meal.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.58,1:05:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you honor us\Nwith your presence?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.08,1:05:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.87,1:05:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to Lord Li's kindness,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.54,1:05:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been taken in as a servant.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.16,1:05:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He may be a demon,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.37,1:05:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,but he has a good heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.87,1:05:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as he behaves,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.58,1:05:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,there's no reason he\Ncan't have a future.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.83,1:05:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonder if the dishes\Nsuit your taste.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.54,1:05:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Not...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.29,1:05:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.49,1:05:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Then have some more.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.58,1:05:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Try this liquor as well.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.37,1:05:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I quit long ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.54,1:05:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Cultivators must sup...\Nsuppress desires.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.29,1:06:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,As the saying goes,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.58,1:06:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,one must cut off urges\Nto perfect the spirit.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.79,1:06:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Another saying goes,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.20,1:06:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,one must practice\Nkindness to polish virtue.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.12,1:06:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Talking won't help.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.54,1:06:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already re... reached\Nthe point of no return.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.41,1:06:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't hide forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.08,1:06:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth will come out one day.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.12,1:06:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,If you continue to harm lives
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.54,1:06:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,making more mistakes,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.91,1:06:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,even if you can\Ndeceive everyone,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.66,1:06:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,you won't be able\Nto fool yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.91,1:06:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And you will not improve\Nfurther on your cultivation,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.54,1:06:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,the essence of which
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.87,1:06:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,is doing good deeds and\Nwalking the righteous path.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.04,1:06:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.66,1:06:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.20,1:06:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You know nothing
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.20,1:06:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,about cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.99,1:06:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.70,1:06:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone is here to\Nsee Master Shen.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.08,1:06:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.08,1:07:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Who did this to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.37,1:07:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Some Taoists.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.24,1:07:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,They attacked us.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.62,1:07:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Father...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.24,1:07:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,had one of his arms
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.12,1:07:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,cut off.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.87,1:07:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Who did it?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.49,1:07:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,His name is...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.37,1:07:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Ne...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.99,1:07:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Zha.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.24,1:07:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations on\Npassing Level 2.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.70,1:07:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Please inform Brother Wuliang.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.37,1:07:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Master is in seclusion\Nrefining pills
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.70,1:07:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,and has not emerged yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.20,1:07:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Before Level 3,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.87,1:07:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,why don't you rest\Nfor a few days?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.87,1:07:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We only have two days left.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.70,1:07:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No need.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.74,1:07:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.99,1:07:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's continue the test.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.04,1:07:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.00,1:07:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,as you wish.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.24,1:07:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The final test
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.49,1:08:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,is the demon Queen\Nof Skull Mountain,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.66,1:08:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Shi Ji.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.54,1:08:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone is requesting an urgent\Nmeeting with Master Taiyi.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.37,1:08:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.16,1:08:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Please help us!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.74,1:08:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Chentang Pass.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.58,1:08:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Something happened!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.70,1:08:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.37,1:08:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.33,1:08:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.08,1:08:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.70,1:08:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.74,1:08:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.95,1:09:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.12,1:09:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.79,1:09:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.20,1:09:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep looking.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.87,1:09:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep looking.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.70,1:09:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I received an urgent report\Nas soon as I ended seclusion.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.37,1:09:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Who could have committed\Nsuch a horrendous crime?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.41,1:09:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Master,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.37,1:09:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,according to Shieldos,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.74,1:09:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,they were struck by\Na tremendous force
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.83,1:09:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,and lost consciousness.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.12,1:09:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,When they woke up,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.20,1:09:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,people of Chentang Pass had\Nalready been slaughtered.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.70,1:09:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We haven't obtained\Nthe elixir yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.33,1:09:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would they do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.49,1:09:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.66,1:09:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,any clue?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.91,1:09:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.04,1:09:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Was just thinking,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.83,1:09:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,where did all this\Nlava come from?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.79,1:10:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.87,1:10:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,There are no volcanoes for\Nhundreds of miles around.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.04,1:10:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This is truly bizarre.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.04,1:10:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, come quick!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.16,1:10:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What demon is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.45,1:10:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.33,1:10:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,left by a dragon's claw.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.54,1:10:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.16,1:10:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The dragons are\Nall in Eastern Sea,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.08,1:10:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,guarding the Suppression Seal.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.08,1:10:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a single one\Ncould have left.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.74,1:10:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Master,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.45,1:10:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,if I remember correctly,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.95,1:10:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Queen Ao Run of Western Sea
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.12,1:10:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,has a special skill
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.87,1:10:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,called the Sky...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.74,1:10:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Sky-Splitting Claw.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.04,1:10:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you saying she used\Nthe Sky-Splitting Claw
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.08,1:10:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,to cross into Chentang Pass?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.58,1:10:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That explains the lava.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.37,1:10:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It must have been transported\Nfrom the purgatory remotely.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.33,1:10:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But she's watched by the\NDragon King of Eastern Sea.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.12,1:10:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's impossible for\Nher to cross over.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.04,1:10:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Then there's only\None possibility left.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.95,1:10:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The thing I worried the most
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.33,1:10:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.20,1:10:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The King of Eastern\NSea has betrayed us?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.12,1:10:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This is too serious\Nan accusation.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.16,1:11:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Could we be wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.04,1:11:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.74,1:11:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's them!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.37,1:11:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.37,1:11:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be impulsive.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.95,1:11:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you heading to\Nthe Dragon Palace?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.66,1:11:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the direction\Nof Skull Mountain.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.33,1:11:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The dragons slaughtered\Ninnocent civilians,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.37,1:11:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,committing this\Nunforgivable atrocity.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.12,1:11:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to consult with\Nfellow Golden Immortals.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.87,1:11:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll strike first\Nand explain later.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.95,1:11:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Crana,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.16,1:11:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,back to the palace with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.20,1:11:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Summon all the Demon Hunters.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.12,1:11:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.87,1:11:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.33,1:11:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Nezha's parents were\Nkilled by demons.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.58,1:11:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't let anything\Nhappen to the child.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.83,1:11:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Go with Deero for him now.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.95,1:11:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.12,1:11:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're\Nheartbroken right now
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.99,1:11:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,but can you please
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.12,1:11:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,calm down for a moment?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.58,1:12:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.41,1:12:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,take me to the\NDragon Palace first?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.33,1:12:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll confront my\Nfather and master
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.87,1:12:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,to get to the bottom of this.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.99,1:12:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Will that bring my parents back?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.54,1:12:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,[Level 3 Skull Mountain]
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.62,1:12:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Mirror mirror on the wall,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.74,1:12:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,who's the fairest within\Nten miles and more?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.66,1:12:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you, my lady.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.24,1:12:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,[Lady Shi Ji]
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.54,1:12:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And who is the fairest within\Na hundred miles? [Lady Shi Ji]
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.08,1:12:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And who is the fairest\Nwithin a hundred miles?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.16,1:12:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you, my lady.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.70,1:12:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What about a thousand miles?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.74,1:12:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.66,1:12:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And ten thousand miles?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.49,1:12:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.95,1:12:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And in the whole world?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.54,1:12:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Still you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.91,1:12:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think I'm stupid?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.04,1:12:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Lie better, at least.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.91,1:12:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.04,1:12:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just trying\Nnot to piss you off.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.45,1:12:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.95,1:12:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Telling the truth\Nwon't hake me mad.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.95,1:12:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.58,1:12:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Lady Shi Ji, am\Nindeed a stumning beauty,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.87,1:12:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,but I know there's\Nalways someone better.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.54,1:12:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on and ask then.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.29,1:12:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I the fairest of them all?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.83,1:13:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.24,1:13:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Fair enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.74,1:13:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Am The fairest within\Nten thousand miles?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.54,1:13:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.00,1:13:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What about a thousand miles?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.45,1:13:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.87,1:13:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hundred miles?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.54,1:13:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.20,1:13:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten miles?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.29,1:13:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.04,1:13:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I even the fairest\Non this mountain?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.45,1:13:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.16,1:13:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Screw you!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.87,1:13:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,There isn't any other\Nfemale in this mountain.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.08,1:13:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm female, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.04,1:13:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You promised you won't get mad.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.41,1:13:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You are prettier than me?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.74,1:13:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.50,1:13:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.33,1:13:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Demon, show yourself!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.87,1:13:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you calling demon?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.29,1:13:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Lady Shi Ji.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.08,1:13:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.91,1:13:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Have we even met?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.91,1:13:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you up to?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.62,1:13:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You will be exposed.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.70,1:13:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.58,1:13:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay out of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.33,1:14:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you can defeat me?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.20,1:14:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The entire mountain is my body.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.83,1:14:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll see how you can destroy me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.91,1:15:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,If you use more force,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.91,1:15:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,your body will collapse!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.58,1:15:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I said
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.08,1:15:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,stay out of it!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.49,1:15:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Already started!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.70,1:15:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.54,1:15:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so screwed.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.04,1:15:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Luckily there's some left.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.49,1:15:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall live to\Nfight another day.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.83,1:15:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.75,1:15:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Just you wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.04,1:15:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Nine-Dragon Fire Trap!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.87,1:15:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,No escape!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.20,1:15:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.04,1:16:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Reckless child.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.45,1:16:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You body has almost gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.95,1:16:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to kill yourself?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.74,1:16:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that fire earlier?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.70,1:16:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't Nezha
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.04,1:16:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,a frost mage?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.66,1:16:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Who... who said that?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.24,1:16:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Frost, flame, I taught it all.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.62,1:16:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,His powers are...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.79,1:16:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,a combination of ice and fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.95,1:16:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that possible?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.74,1:16:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The Spirit Pearl is endowed\Nwith unparalleled talents.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.70,1:16:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't judge him by\Nnormal standards.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.91,1:16:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Which one of us is the teacher?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.04,1:16:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you know\Nbetter than me?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.33,1:16:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't dare.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.08,1:16:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.08,1:16:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I did sense a strong presence
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.08,1:16:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,of demonic energy earlier
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.24,1:16:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,About that...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.70,1:16:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Shi Ji must have released it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.20,1:16:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying, fatty?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.79,1:16:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I did not...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.87,1:16:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it you? Was it\Nyou? Was it you?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.58,1:16:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Say it!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.20,1:16:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It was me, it was me!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.58,1:16:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop shaking!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.54,1:16:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm about to throw up!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.04,1:16:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,See? I told you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.20,1:16:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Nezha,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.04,1:16:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,you've passed three levels.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.16,1:16:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Today,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.79,1:16:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I will personally cast
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.45,1:16:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,the Ascension Spell for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.33,1:17:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been through all\Nof this long long ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.37,1:17:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I was probably too nervous.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.04,1:17:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ascension Spell is\Nlonger than I remember.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.24,1:17:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.33,1:17:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,you're an Immortal\Nof the Chan Sect.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.99,1:17:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This Yu Xu Treasure Vault
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.20,1:17:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,houses all sorts of\Nrare magic items.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.37,1:17:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Elixir Reparo.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.87,1:17:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You can only pick one.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.49,1:17:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you need more\Ntime to decide?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.95,1:17:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Elixir Reparo.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.12,1:19:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu Xu Palace has sent messengers
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.41,1:19:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,to inform the Twelve about\Nwhat the dragons did.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.04,1:19:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,However, due to\Nthe great distance,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.70,1:19:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,my brothers and sisters\Ncan't make it here sooner.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.04,1:19:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,[Tianyuan Cauldron] my brothers and\Nsisters can't make it here sooner.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.20,1:19:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This time, [Tianyuan Cauldron]
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.12,1:19:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I will personally lead the\Nhunt [Tianyuan Cauldron]
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.45,1:19:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,on the dragons.\N[Tianyuan Cauldron]
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.50,1:19:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,On the dragons.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.87,1:19:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Nezha,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.04,1:19:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I will you fight alongside me?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.99,1:19:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go back to\NChentang Pass first.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.54,1:19:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we'll seek revenge\Non the Dragon King.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.29,1:19:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.58,1:19:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,With your extraordinary\Ncombat skills,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.54,1:19:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,you'd be a great help in\Ndestroying the Dragon Palace.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.87,1:19:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I've paid back
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.74,1:19:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,everything I owed you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.95,1:19:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.08,1:19:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait until my body is restored.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.41,1:19:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go to the Dragon\NPalace together, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.70,1:20:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You know well what\NI'm going to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.62,1:20:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You being there will\Nonly make it harder.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.16,1:20:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time we meet,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.20,1:20:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,we're foes instead of friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.29,1:20:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.00,1:20:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Karma it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.45,1:20:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you can't leave!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.29,1:20:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Your soul will scatter before\Nyou get to the Dragon Palace.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.12,1:20:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Nine-Dragon Fire Trap!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.29,1:20:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down, will you?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.79,1:20:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Going now
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.54,1:20:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,won't change anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.12,1:20:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.49,1:20:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I promised Nezha I'd\Nsave you no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.14,1:21:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Pah! Pah!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.54,1:21:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Suffocating!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.43,1:21:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,[Relic of Dragon Palace]
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.39,1:21:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.43,1:22:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Immortal Wuliang\Nof the Chan Sect.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.43,1:22:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Ao Guang,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.51,1:22:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,do you admit your guilt?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.72,1:22:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.97,1:22:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,you've found out?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.59,1:22:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Is
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.47,1:22:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Ao Bing still alive?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.26,1:22:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll accept whatever\Npunishment you give,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.64,1:22:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,but please spare my son.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.59,1:22:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.18,1:22:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The Court of Heaven ordered your\Nclan to suppress the sea monsters.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.80,1:22:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead, you colluded with them
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.64,1:22:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,and slaughtered Chentang Pass.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.05,1:22:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Chentang Pass?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.30,1:22:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The dragons have committed\Nan unforgivable crime.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.18,1:22:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Today,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.80,1:22:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,justice shall be meted.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.80,1:22:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Encompassed are the\Nearth and the skies.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.47,1:22:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Unleash the power\Nwith boundless might.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.14,1:22:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the Tianyuan\Nrise and stand tall.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.97,1:22:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Reign supreme above them all.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.47,1:22:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Open Cauldron!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.01,1:23:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Show yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.97,1:23:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you done\Nto Chentang Pass?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.09,1:23:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't big brother tell us
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.59,1:23:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,to follow Master Shen's orders?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.18,1:23:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Shen Gongbao?!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.97,1:23:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of the emergency,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.05,1:23:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,you should focus on present.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.84,1:23:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,My king,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.68,1:24:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,we can't sit here\Nand wait to die!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.89,1:24:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If I go into battle,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.18,1:24:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,the Suppression Seal will...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.51,1:24:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave that to us.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.51,1:24:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Joining all our powers,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.47,1:24:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,we can hold it for long enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.14,1:24:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.89,1:24:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had enough!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.14,1:24:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You wretched demon!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.09,1:24:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a once-in-a-millennium\Nchance for revenge.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.14,1:24:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Break out of the purgatory!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.43,1:24:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroy the Dragon Palace!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.97,1:26:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Soul Blade!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.05,1:26:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Old fool!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.84,1:26:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Taste my sword!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.18,1:27:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Releasing demonic\Nenergy like this...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.80,1:27:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,aren't you afraid of\Nexposing your identity?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.05,1:27:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.01,1:27:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,if you dared to\Nharm Chentang Pass,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.72,1:27:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,would smash your\Npalace into PIECES!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.93,1:27:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.76,1:27:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Ao Bing dead?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.47,1:28:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Move! Out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.18,1:29:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Rise!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.80,1:30:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have a death wish?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.80,1:30:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see how long\Nyour body can take it.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.14,1:30:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care if I live or die.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.97,1:30:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you're dead!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.30,1:30:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Now is the time!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.43,1:31:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Look what you've done!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.51,1:31:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Is annihilation for all\Nreally what you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.64,1:31:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The chains.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.55,1:31:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the Eastern Sea Dragon\NKing can't match your power.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.84,1:31:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I was right after all.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.34,1:31:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You're exactly what\Nthe Chan Sect needs.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.30,1:31:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Your parents spent their\Nlives fighting evil.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.47,1:31:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.47,1:31:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,you must carry on their legacy
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.47,1:31:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,and eliminate all the demons.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.64,1:31:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me avenge your loss
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.30,1:31:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,by turning these\Nbastards into pills.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.01,1:31:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Escort me!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.43,1:31:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, master!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.72,1:32:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Nezha!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.09,1:32:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Nezha!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.39,1:32:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Nezha!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.89,1:32:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Nezha!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.26,1:32:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Nezha!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.47,1:32:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.43,1:32:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Nezha!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.47,1:32:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.59,1:32:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Nezha!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.43,1:32:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Nezha!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.14,1:33:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Son, are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.09,1:33:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Your body...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.64,1:33:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I... I...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.97,1:33:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,They already know
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.22,1:33:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,about you and Ao Bing.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.09,1:33:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I... I...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.34,1:33:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.68,1:33:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd never see you again.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.47,1:33:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Master is still\Ncasting the spell.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.05,1:33:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to buy as\Nmuch time as we can.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.14,1:33:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Nezha,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.80,1:33:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,it wasn't my father who\Nslaughtered Chentang Pass.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.18,1:33:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The real culprit
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.93,1:33:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,is him, the Immortal Wuliang!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.64,1:34:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Shieldos!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.68,1:34:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragons?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.14,1:34:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.93,1:34:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,it's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.80,1:34:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.60,1:34:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Shen Gongbao,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.40,1:34:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,you collude with the dragons.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.98,1:35:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you up to?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.23,1:35:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Should be ask... asking you.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.64,1:35:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You captured my father.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.10,1:35:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you up to?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.31,1:35:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Who said I captured your father?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.77,1:35:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Only you know my\Nfamily's situation.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.85,1:35:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,If you didn't give the order,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.89,1:35:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,why would Nezha and the Demon\NHunters hunt my father down?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.52,1:35:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And my little brother's\Narrow wound...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.98,1:35:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's obviously
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.94,1:35:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,caused by your disciple, Deero!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.48,1:35:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,There's the talent\NI recruited myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.31,1:35:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing slips past you.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.94,1:35:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, I've done your\Ndirty work for so many years.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.23,1:35:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I can also guess\Nyour purpose here
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.98,1:35:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,putting up a show\Nin Chentang Pass.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.31,1:35:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You are trying to fram...\Nframe the dragons, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.98,1:35:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this how you repay me,\Nyour brother and mentor?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.06,1:35:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You've always use...\Nused me for your benefit.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.35,1:35:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Between you and me,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.69,1:35:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,there's only grudge,\Nnot gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.14,1:36:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,May I interest you in a deal?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.98,1:36:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Immortal.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.06,1:36:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,As the overseer of Yu Xu Palace,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.94,1:36:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,you must know the spell to unhinge\Nthe Sea-Stabilizing Chains.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.31,1:36:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.98,1:36:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.35,1:36:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You... you are going to rebel?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.23,1:36:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,A thousand years ago, the four of us\Nfought the celestial realm together.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.02,1:36:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Who has then betrayed us and
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.44,1:36:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,cast us into the purgatory?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.81,1:36:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Wuliang is\Ntargeting Ao Guang,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.39,1:36:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,that's exactly what we want.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.48,1:36:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I've long heard that Immortal\NWuliang recruit talents without bias.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.35,1:36:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I trust it you know\Nwell what we can do.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.81,1:36:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can free us\Nfrom the purgatory
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.44,1:36:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,and help us achieve immortality,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.31,1:36:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,we are willing to offer\Nour humble service.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.98,1:36:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus the secret of the Spirit\NPearl and the Demon Orb.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.60,1:36:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The Spirit Pearl\Nand the Demon Orb?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.19,1:36:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.10,1:36:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Whe... where's your\Nspirit of fighting back?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.44,1:36:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We were young and ignorant!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.84,1:36:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,A thousand years of imprisonment
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.89,1:37:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,has taught us about the rules
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.80,1:37:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,and the rulers.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.18,1:37:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Smart.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.47,1:37:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're so unpredictable.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.51,1:37:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I trust you?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.43,1:37:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless you let me\Nplace on you...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.30,1:37:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We are willing.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.76,1:37:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The three dragons\Nwillingly agreed
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.47,1:37:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,to let Wuliang place\Na curse on them.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.84,1:37:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,If they dare to\Ndisobey in the future,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.59,1:37:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Wuliang can take their\Nlives at any time.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.39,1:37:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Wuliang then\Nfulfilled his promise,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.76,1:37:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,freeing them from the\NSea-Stabilizing Chains.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.59,1:37:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Whenever a powerful\Nforce is discovered,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.59,1:37:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,he orchestrates massacres,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.84,1:37:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,frames them,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.80,1:37:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,and sends troops\Nto capture them.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.14,1:37:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,According to Shen Gongbao,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.59,1:37:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,he had carried out many\Nsuch tasks for Wuliang
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.80,1:37:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,in exchange for a chance\Nto join the Chan Sect.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.18,1:37:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This time, Wuliang came\Nto destroy Chentang Pass
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.14,1:38:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,and frame the dragons\Nof Eastern Sea.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:01.51,1:38:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,One thing led to another,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.18,1:38:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,he ended up recruiting\Nthe three dragon kings.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.05,1:38:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And from them,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.34,1:38:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,he learned the secret of the\NDemon Orb and the Spirit Pearl.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.55,1:38:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,After that,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.55,1:38:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,they deliberately left\Ntwo clueless survivors
Dialogue: 0,1:38:15.18,1:38:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,to tell Yu Xu Palace\Nwhat happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.01,1:38:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Seeing no hope of\Nbreaking through,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.97,1:38:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Shen Gongbao came\Nup with a plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.80,1:38:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He had the Yaksha petrify us,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.26,1:38:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,then hide us in the sewers.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:48.76,1:38:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Later, he waited for the\Nright time to revive us.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.22,1:38:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And you?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.68,1:38:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,My families are gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:55.97,1:38:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I have nothing\Nleft to hold onto.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.47,1:39:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Over there!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.76,1:39:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The demons captured\Nby the Demon Hunters
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.64,1:39:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,are not, as outsiders think,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.64,1:39:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,being reformed in Yu Xu Palace.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:26.18,1:39:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead, they are thrown into\Nthe Tianyuan Cauldron by Wuliang,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.72,1:39:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,refined into pills\Nof immortality
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.26,1:39:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,to strengthen the\NChan Sect's power.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.80,1:39:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:34.84,1:39:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,how could you commit\Nsuch atrocities?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:37.55,1:39:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,How...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.26,1:39:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you going\Nto face our master
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.59,1:39:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,and the teachings we received?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.72,1:39:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you know\Nwhat Wuliang did,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.89,1:39:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,you should stop\Nbefore it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.80,1:39:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Take him back to the palace
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.34,1:39:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,to face punishment\Nfrom the Supreme Lord.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.22,1:40:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The Demon Hunters were personally\Ntrained by Master Wuliang.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:00.47,1:40:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think a few words\Nwould turn us against him?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.55,1:40:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:05.80,1:40:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I was wrong about the dragons.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.15,1:40:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Let them go!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.54,1:40:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me help.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.46,1:40:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You betrayed us?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:58.92,1:41:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We learned that from\Nyou, Big Brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.63,1:41:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Back then, in order\Nto protect our kind,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:03.09,1:41:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I had no choice!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:04.67,1:41:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, in order to\Nprotect myself now,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.09,1:41:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Neither do I.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:10.75,1:41:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,My King, wait for us!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:12.09,1:41:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't leave us behind!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.25,1:41:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,My King, take us with you!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.67,1:41:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,My King! My King!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:21.46,1:41:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You've all been sold out!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:32.46,1:41:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragon King of Southern Sea.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:38.00,1:41:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragon King of Northern Sea.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.75,1:41:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Queen of Western Sea.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:45.17,1:41:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,[Ao Qin, Ao Run, Ao Shun]
Dialogue: 0,1:41:56.17,1:41:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Nephew,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.79,1:41:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,it's playtime with\Nyour second uncle.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.46,1:42:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Take my spear!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:18.17,1:42:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Take my axe!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:22.17,1:42:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Take my wheel!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:56.50,1:42:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Take my wheel times a hundred!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.79,1:42:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Two hundreds!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.59,1:42:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Three hundreds!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.04,1:43:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.38,1:43:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Bullshit!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:08.54,1:43:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,There weren't that many.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.25,1:43:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Your body is still unstable.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:11.17,1:43:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't exhaust yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.00,1:43:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,For my mistakes,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:13.42,1:43:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I would give my life\Nfor freeing the dragons.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:17.71,1:43:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Young and vicious.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.17,1:43:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me have some fun\Nwith you, little one.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:54.79,1:43:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Bullying children,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.63,1:43:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,shameless and vile!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:06.67,1:44:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.84,1:44:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you hit your\Nmaster's brother!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.17,1:44:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Bullying an uncle,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:10.13,1:44:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,eat a knuckle!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.00,1:44:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,This won't do.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.84,1:44:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a mess.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:52.17,1:44:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's make it messier.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:53.21,1:44:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How about some vapor?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:55.38,1:44:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.50,1:45:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Take them down!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:07.84,1:45:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out for sneak attacks.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:16.84,1:45:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.50,1:45:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful, it's me!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:22.04,1:45:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.00,1:45:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:24.63,1:45:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Nezha!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:28.17,1:45:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:31.50,1:45:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Surprise!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.50,1:45:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,LOL!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.59,1:45:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Transformation Spell?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:41.42,1:45:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you insane?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.50,1:45:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't fool me.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:45.92,1:45:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:47.46,1:45:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Which one of you...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:48.54,1:45:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Code.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:49.00,1:45:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,She sells seashells\Nby the seashore.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.67,1:45:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.67,1:45:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know the code.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:52.75,1:45:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Imposter!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:55.25,1:45:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So you really are an imposter!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:02.09,1:46:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:09.79,1:46:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Serves you right.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:12.04,1:46:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.00,1:46:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Code.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.75,1:46:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh... he sells bells\Nin the big well?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:19.84,1:46:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrong!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:21.04,1:46:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's "she sells seashells\Nby the seashore"
Dialogue: 0,1:46:23.04,1:46:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,and the shells she sells\Nall smell for sure”.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:25.34,1:46:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the real one!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:26.59,1:46:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How come I don't know this code?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.00,1:46:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We just made it up!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.38,1:46:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you make it easier?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:34.04,1:46:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too hard!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:37.96,1:46:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.59,1:46:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Go away!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:40.25,1:46:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Imposter!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:41.09,1:46:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the real Ao Shun!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:42.50,1:46:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap! You don't know the code!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:44.00,1:46:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Neither do you!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:46.25,1:46:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:46.96,1:46:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Does it mean I'm\Nan imposter, too?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:50.09,1:46:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,My goodness.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:51.96,1:46:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Tai Chi flows in harmony divine.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:53.25,1:46:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Five elements perfectly align.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:54.50,1:46:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,True fire of Samadhi\Nignites the gold.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.96,1:46:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,A perfect pill,\Nits power unfolds.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:57.25,1:46:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Swift and Uplift!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:27.34,1:47:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you so scared?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:28.84,1:47:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We used to bathe in\Nlava like it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.84,1:47:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hot! Hot!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:37.13,1:47:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:37.80,1:47:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the true fire of Samadhi.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:41.84,1:47:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you looking at?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:43.25,1:47:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If anyone should\Neat this, it's me!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:49.00,1:47:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yum.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:55.00,1:47:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go of my father!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:57.17,1:47:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyah!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:57.75,1:47:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Freeze!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:09.84,1:48:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What a Spirit Pearl!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:11.67,1:48:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect match with\Nthe Demon Orb.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:16.21,1:48:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Ao Bing!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:19.50,1:48:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyah!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:20.67,1:48:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Freeze!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:33.04,1:48:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:33.50,1:48:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The Heart-Piercing Curse.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:35.34,1:48:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Since I already knew\Nyour true identities,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:39.17,1:48:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,how could not have\Na backup plan?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:44.67,1:48:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:45.50,1:48:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That curse is quite complex.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:46.84,1:48:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,When did you cast it?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:49.75,1:48:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,1:48:50.84,1:48:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why the Ascension\NSpell took so long.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:53.38,1:48:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You slipped in something.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:26.29,1:49:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You old fart!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:32.04,1:49:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the Demon Orb
Dialogue: 0,1:49:34.00,1:49:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,won't be able to break the\NHeart-Piercing Curse so quick.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:38.84,1:49:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,A thousand spikes have pierced\Nthrough your nerves and veins.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:43.54,1:49:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Forcing any movement
Dialogue: 0,1:49:45.21,1:49:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,will only result in your body
Dialogue: 0,1:49:47.09,1:49:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,being torn apart.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:50.21,1:49:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No wonder I couldn't\Nsense any living aura.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:54.79,1:49:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You were petrified.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:57.50,1:49:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But you staying alive
Dialogue: 0,1:49:58.88,1:50:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,only harms Nezha.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:02.84,1:50:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The Spirit Pearl
Dialogue: 0,1:50:05.67,1:50:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,and the Demon Orb
Dialogue: 0,1:50:07.96,1:50:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,are precious treasures.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:10.38,1:50:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to treat you well,
Dialogue: 0,1:50:17.21,1:50:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,but now you'll just\Nserve as pills.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:35.29,1:50:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Ao Bing!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:36.67,1:50:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:37.34,1:50:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:38.09,1:50:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,you're still alive!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:39.42,1:50:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ungh!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:40.84,1:50:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Heart-Piercing\NCurse casted by Wuliang.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:42.59,1:50:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And he was the one that slaughtered\NChentang Pass, framing it on the dragons.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:48.38,1:50:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 0,1:50:49.17,1:50:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Nezha was deceived.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:50.50,1:50:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't blame him.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:51.46,1:50:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever you want\Nto do, do it to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:52.84,1:50:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave my parents out of this.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:59.96,1:51:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Killing you won't\Nchange anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:16.88,1:51:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all doomed to die here.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:19.46,1:51:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,If anyone still holds grudges,
Dialogue: 0,1:51:23.21,1:51:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,be my guest.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:33.04,1:51:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother,
Dialogue: 0,1:51:34.34,1:51:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,the Chan Sect has\Na noble reputation,
Dialogue: 0,1:51:36.50,1:51:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,how could you commit\Nsuch a horrible offense?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:40.50,1:51:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make more mistakes!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:41.75,1:51:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you go back\Nand confess to Master?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:43.88,1:51:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll plead for mercy\Non your behalf.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:45.67,1:51:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:46.88,1:51:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Indiscriminate fool!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:49.50,1:51:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Should the immortals' place\Nin the world be secured,
Dialogue: 0,1:51:52.67,1:51:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,or you ungrateful\Nslackers are half as
Dialogue: 0,1:51:55.46,1:51:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,diligent as the demons,
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.84,1:52:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't have wasted\Nthis much time and effort!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:00.67,1:52:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if it leads to my own doom
Dialogue: 0,1:52:02.84,1:52:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,and infamy,
Dialogue: 0,1:52:04.50,1:52:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I did it for the eternal\Ndominance of Chan Sect.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:08.17,1:52:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,My conscience...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:09.79,1:52:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,conscience...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:10.88,1:52:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,conscience...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.46,1:52:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,My conscience is clear.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:20.96,1:52:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Another one is done.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:22.50,1:52:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't possibly eat any more.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:24.09,1:52:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You should try some.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:25.17,1:52:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:26.21,1:52:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,When my fins are done,\Nyou should try some too.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:28.67,1:52:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The claws are ready as well.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:30.25,1:52:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We should swap and share.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:32.34,1:52:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:34.46,1:52:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,My body...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:38.88,1:52:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,He's become a pill!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:40.09,1:52:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still so young.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:41.67,1:52:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't want to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:43.04,1:52:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No, let me out.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:44.71,1:52:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:46.42,1:52:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay calm!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:48.00,1:52:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Focus all your energy!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:50.00,1:52:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on for as long as you can.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:59.79,1:53:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Son!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:01.00,1:53:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Your power is greater than mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:02.46,1:53:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You can get through.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:04.04,1:53:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can hold out until the\NHeart-Piercing Curse fades,
Dialogue: 0,1:53:06.34,1:53:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll have a chance to escape.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:08.13,1:53:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The Heart-Piercing Curse\Ntakes at least six hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:11.04,1:53:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid...
Dialogue: 0,1:53:12.34,1:53:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't be able\Nto last that long.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:19.92,1:53:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,My lady.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:20.42,1:53:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:20.96,1:53:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, mom.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:22.04,1:53:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Nezha, Nezha?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:26.09,1:53:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Nezha.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:26.92,1:53:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:28.59,1:53:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You and Dad must not give up.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:30.21,1:53:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about us.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:31.59,1:53:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to
Dialogue: 0,1:53:32.84,1:53:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,stay focused.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:34.46,1:53:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:35.84,1:53:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't feel the fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:37.50,1:53:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing kills you, kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:39.59,1:53:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,If I am correct,
Dialogue: 0,1:53:42.17,1:53:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,flames of the Demon Orb and\Nthe true fire of Samadhi
Dialogue: 0,1:53:44.75,1:53:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,share the same origin.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:46.63,1:53:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Then the Tianyuan\NCauldron can't harm you.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:49.96,1:53:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:50.84,1:53:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,My mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:56.04,1:53:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't bother.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:57.38,1:53:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This is just my avatar.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:01.42,1:54:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,As suspected, the Demon Orb
Dialogue: 0,1:54:03.21,1:54:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,is indestructible.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:04.84,1:54:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No wonder the Supreme Lord had to\Ndestroy you with the Wrath of Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:14.17,1:54:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Nezha,
Dialogue: 0,1:54:16.34,1:54:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I see you're a good son.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:19.63,1:54:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,How about I give you a\Nchance to prove that?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:22.04,1:54:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The Oblivion Pill.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:24.17,1:54:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Swallow it
Dialogue: 0,1:54:25.84,1:54:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'll release your parents.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:28.29,1:54:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:29.67,1:54:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I may be ruthless,
Dialogue: 0,1:54:32.17,1:54:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,but I always keep my promises.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:34.84,1:54:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, all those\Nelites of the demons
Dialogue: 0,1:54:38.63,1:54:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,wouldn't swear loyalty to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:40.42,1:54:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you swallow it,
Dialogue: 0,1:54:42.84,1:54:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear to Heaven,
Dialogue: 0,1:54:45.17,1:54:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't harm your parents.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:02.00,1:55:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:03.50,1:55:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Using his parents'\Nlives to threaten a kid?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:06.59,1:55:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And you call yourself a god?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:08.46,1:55:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You aren't even\Nworthy to be a human.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:12.42,1:55:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Nezha,
Dialogue: 0,1:55:13.50,1:55:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,leave us be.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:14.63,1:55:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You must live.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:16.88,1:55:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on until the\NHeart-Piercing Curse is broken
Dialogue: 0,1:55:18.84,1:55:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,or your two brothers find you.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:21.00,1:55:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You really think I can't\Nkill the Demon Orb?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:24.42,1:55:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a matter of time.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:26.75,1:55:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you're dead,
Dialogue: 0,1:55:28.17,1:55:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a hundred\Nways to destroy him.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:36.34,1:55:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want to have\Na meaningful death.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:40.79,1:55:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Why won't you let me die?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:44.38,1:55:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Why won't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:47.59,1:55:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,If your trade your\Nlife for ours,
Dialogue: 0,1:55:50.67,1:55:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,do you think we\Ncould live in peace?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:56.29,1:55:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Nezha.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:57.75,1:56:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No, mom.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:00.63,1:56:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:02.04,1:56:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:03.25,1:56:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the end.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:06.17,1:56:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Just want to hug\Nyou one last time.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:09.46,1:56:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:12.09,1:56:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I won't get\Nto see you grow up.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:16.25,1:56:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on,
Dialogue: 0,1:56:19.04,1:56:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll have to\Nwalk your own path.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:29.84,1:57:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I... I'm useless.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:33.04,1:57:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,So useless.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:35.71,1:57:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I was born a demon,
Dialogue: 0,1:57:38.67,1:57:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,and have always caused you pain.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:42.38,1:57:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted so badly,
Dialogue: 0,1:57:43.75,1:57:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,to make you proud.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:52.34,1:57:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:55.84,1:57:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:57.34,1:57:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:00.00,1:58:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:03.17,1:58:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Every day I spent with you,
Dialogue: 0,1:58:06.79,1:58:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:10.38,1:58:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I never cared
Dialogue: 0,1:58:14.09,1:58:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,whether you were an immortal
Dialogue: 0,1:58:15.84,1:58:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,or a demon.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:18.34,1:58:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,All I know is
Dialogue: 0,1:58:20.84,1:58:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,you are my son.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:25.67,1:58:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy
Dialogue: 0,1:58:27.42,1:58:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,will always
Dialogue: 0,1:58:29.71,1:58:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,love...
Dialogue: 0,1:59:11.17,1:59:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Nezha, stay calm!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:12.75,1:59:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:13.67,1:59:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Your body will be torn apart!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:58.34,2:00:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The True Fire of Samadhi\Nhas compensated for
Dialogue: 0,2:00:01.67,2:00:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,the fire needed for\Nthe body restoration.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:03.84,2:00:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Nezha's physical form
Dialogue: 0,2:00:07.17,2:00:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,is complete now!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:24.42,2:00:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad,
Dialogue: 0,2:00:26.50,2:00:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,take care of Mom.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:40.34,2:00:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me break the cauldron!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:15.25,2:01:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:15.96,2:01:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,They are absorbing the energy\Nof the Tianyuan Cauldron!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:19.46,2:01:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Roota Maxima!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:46.88,2:01:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Demon Hunters, by my command,
Dialogue: 0,2:01:48.84,2:01:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,march!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:45.09,2:02:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 0,2:02:46.05,2:02:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,you need to save your\Nenergy for self-protection.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:47.64,2:02:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been backing down
Dialogue: 0,2:02:49.01,2:02:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,for far too long.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:50.68,2:02:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We thought if we\Ngave everything,
Dialogue: 0,2:02:52.09,2:02:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,then Wuliang would let us live.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:54.51,2:02:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But in the end, they\Nstill want us dead.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:57.43,2:02:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's what they want,
Dialogue: 0,2:02:59.97,2:03:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,then we'll fight them to death!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:03.26,2:03:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, let's fight!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:05.55,2:03:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Fight! Fight! Fight!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:19.14,2:03:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't let them out!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:08.14,2:04:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not give up!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:09.64,2:04:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:35.72,2:04:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Make it...
Dialogue: 0,2:04:38.14,2:04:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,break!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:31.39,2:05:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The cauldron!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:32.47,2:05:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,My cauldron!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:33.89,2:05:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,There goes the\Nfoundation of Chan Sect!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:32.05,2:06:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill all these bastards!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:40.55,2:06:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:16.80,2:07:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You ungrateful traitors.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:20.26,2:07:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't tell right from wrong!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:34.43,2:07:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Roaring Dragon Waves!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:46.68,2:07:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So those two minions of\Nhis are monsters too.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:49.68,2:07:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Demons, immortals,
Dialogue: 0,2:07:51.47,2:07:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,it's all part of your trickery!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:54.80,2:07:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You despicable lowlife.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:56.64,2:07:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you oppose me!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:22.30,2:08:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Witness my true powers!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:20.05,2:10:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you two
Dialogue: 0,2:10:21.84,2:10:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,one last chance because\NI value talents.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:23.80,2:10:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Surrender now
Dialogue: 0,2:10:25.39,2:10:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'll grant you immortality.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:27.30,2:10:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell with immortality!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:29.76,2:10:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm all demon.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:31.97,2:10:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:36.55,2:10:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You claim to be a guiding light,
Dialogue: 0,2:10:38.64,2:10:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,but all you do is\Nbully the weak,
Dialogue: 0,2:10:40.22,2:10:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,and bring chaos to the world.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:42.47,2:10:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You are the real evil!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:53.26,2:10:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ignorant fools,
Dialogue: 0,2:10:54.76,2:10:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,the immortals rule the world.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:56.64,2:10:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Siding with the powerful\Nis the only way out.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:59.72,2:11:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Either accept that or
Dialogue: 0,2:11:01.80,2:11:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll have no place to run to.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:04.30,2:11:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,If there is no way ahead,
Dialogue: 0,2:11:06.09,2:11:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,then I will carve out a path!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:11.47,2:11:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,If the world won't\Naccommodate me,
Dialogue: 0,2:11:14.14,2:11:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I will turn the\Nworld upside down!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:27.97,2:11:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:30.47,2:11:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,My face...
Dialogue: 0,2:11:32.72,2:11:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,2:11:33.60,2:11:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You fools broke\Nmy Ageless Spell!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:37.47,2:11:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Old fart.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:51.47,2:11:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Ba... back to the palace.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:06.34,2:12:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,2:12:50.76,2:12:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,My father plans to\Nlead the dragons
Dialogue: 0,2:12:52.47,2:12:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,deep into the\Nocean to hide away.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:54.22,2:12:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that your\Nidentity is exposed,
Dialogue: 0,2:12:55.76,2:12:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,why don't you come with us?
Dialogue: 0,2:12:57.84,2:12:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:59.59,2:13:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I used to keep hiding
Dialogue: 0,2:13:01.68,2:13:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,and running away,
Dialogue: 0,2:13:03.09,2:13:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,until there was\Nnowhere to left to go.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:05.39,2:13:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I finally know how\Nto face this world.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:08.18,2:13:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wuliang is one of the\Nmost powerful immortals
Dialogue: 0,2:13:10.18,2:13:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,and is trusted by\Nthe Supreme Lord.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:12.51,2:13:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He may not fall so easily.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:14.26,2:13:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, immortals and demons\Nwalk different paths,
Dialogue: 0,2:13:16.47,2:13:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,like water and fire.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:18.55,2:13:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Immortals, demons...
Dialogue: 0,2:13:20.30,2:13:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are just excuses for\Ncontrolling those who are different.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:24.89,2:13:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,2:13:26.43,2:13:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you can change that?
Dialogue: 0,2:13:33.39,2:13:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to try.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:37.30,2:13:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I'm too old
Dialogue: 0,2:13:39.51,2:13:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,to fight against the world.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:42.97,2:13:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Ao Bing.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:19.55,2:14:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that
Dialogue: 0,2:14:20.97,2:14:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,once you've made up your mind,
Dialogue: 0,2:14:22.80,2:14:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll always follow through.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:25.76,2:14:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,My son,
Dialogue: 0,2:14:27.01,2:14:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,in the past,
Dialogue: 0,2:14:28.59,2:14:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I put too much burden on you.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:30.68,2:14:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I never even
Dialogue: 0,2:14:31.76,2:14:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,listened to you carefully.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:33.93,2:14:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I apologize.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:36.26,2:14:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I only wanted to use my experience\Nto give you a good life.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:40.97,2:14:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,But now I see,
Dialogue: 0,2:14:42.14,2:14:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,the experience of\Nthe older generation
Dialogue: 0,2:14:43.89,2:14:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,is but the past,
Dialogue: 0,2:14:45.43,2:14:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,and may not be right for you.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:48.97,2:14:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You must walk your own path.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:52.64,2:14:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on,
Dialogue: 0,2:14:54.64,2:14:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,follow your heart.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:28.30,2:15:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Knew you'd come back.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:30.14,2:15:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,2:15:32.30,2:15:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Because we are both too young.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:37.47,2:15:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Too naive to know the\Nlimits of the world.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:32.82,2:17:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Master.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:33.86,2:17:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Your face...
Dialogue: 0,2:17:35.15,2:17:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:36.78,2:17:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Crana has helped\Napply some medicine.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:39.28,2:17:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,With Tianyuan\NCauldron destroyed,
Dialogue: 0,2:17:40.40,2:17:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Chan Sect no longer has\Na guaranteed victory.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:42.40,2:17:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We've committed a grave sin.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:45.15,2:17:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We must act before the Supreme\NLord returns from seclusion.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:49.36,2:17:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Come,
Dialogue: 0,2:17:49.99,2:17:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,let's go see him.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:52.03,2:17:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the holding cell\Nconcealed well?
Dialogue: 0,2:17:54.78,2:17:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody else can come in here.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:56.40,2:17:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The cell inside is\Nshielded with a spell.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:58.28,2:17:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The door can only be opened
Dialogue: 0,2:17:59.24,2:18:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,by you and one other guard only.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:01.49,2:18:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:09.40,2:18:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Slacking off.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:10.82,2:18:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Snoozing on the job.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:17.19,2:18:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What is going on?
Dialogue: 0,2:18:18.40,2:18:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This door
Dialogue: 0,2:18:19.49,2:18:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,uses facial recognition.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:20.53,2:18:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Your appearance has changed,
Dialogue: 0,2:18:22.53,2:18:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,and will need to be re-entered.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:24.82,2:18:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Redo it.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:53.28,2:18:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You dare to laugh at me?
Dialogue: 0,2:18:55.57,2:18:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse you to sleep\Nfor ten years.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:04.69,2:19:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you suffering,
Dialogue: 0,2:19:05.90,2:19:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother?
Dialogue: 0,2:19:09.36,2:19:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother is the one\Nwho has suffered.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:11.57,2:19:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Who has... has beat\Nyou up like this?
Dialogue: 0,2:19:14.82,2:19:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:15.90,2:19:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know why I\Nrecruited you in the past?
Dialogue: 0,2:19:20.65,2:19:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted your demon identity
Dialogue: 0,2:19:24.15,2:19:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,so that in the Deification War,
Dialogue: 0,2:19:26.40,2:19:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I could entrust you\Nwith important tasks.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:30.28,2:19:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You're delusional!
Dialogue: 0,2:19:33.90,2:19:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Father [Shen Zhengdao]
Dialogue: 0,2:19:36.40,2:19:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:37.74,2:19:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still breathing.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:39.86,2:19:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,If you will let me\Nplace a curse on you,
Dialogue: 0,2:19:43.15,2:19:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,then your father can enjoy
Dialogue: 0,2:19:45.90,2:19:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,a peaceful life at Yu Xu Palace.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:51.28,2:19:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The two people you've\Nasked for are here.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:53.24,2:19:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Think carefully about it.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:02.82,2:20:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,2:20:04.94,2:20:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The medicine from\Nearlier has taken effect.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:07.61,2:20:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what can we do?
Dialogue: 0,2:20:08.65,2:20:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Who else can open the door?
Dialogue: 0,2:20:16.61,2:20:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten years...
Dialogue: 0,2:20:25.40,2:20:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinzha of Five Dragon\NMountain, Yunxiao Cave.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:27.03,2:20:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,[Jinzha] Jinzha of Five\NDragon Mountain, Yunxiao Cave.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:27.53,2:20:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Muzha of Jiugong Mountain,\NWhite Egret Cave. [Jinzha]
Dialogue: 0,2:20:28.11,2:20:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,[Muzha] Muzha of Jiugong Mountain,\NWhite Egret Cave. [Jinzha]
Dialogue: 0,2:20:29.94,2:20:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Responding the summons\Nto return to palace.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:37.11,2:20:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Master.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:38.11,2:20:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Bear with it.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:44.11,2:20:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That should be enough.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:52.19,2:20:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I think
Dialogue: 0,2:20:53.44,2:20:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,the left eye isn't\Nswollen enough.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:55.24,2:20:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The right cheek\Nneeds adjustment.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:59.19,2:21:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,2:21:00.65,2:21:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you two laughing just now?
Dialogue: 0,2:21:02.40,2:21:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I dare not.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:03.36,2:21:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Master is suffering
Dialogue: 0,2:21:04.24,2:21:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,and my heart hurts a\Nhundred times more.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:06.32,2:21:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,2:21:06.78,2:21:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Absolutely true.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:07.94,2:21:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Heaven and earth bears witness.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:13.99,2:21:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, that's enough.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:26.90,2:21:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I think
Dialogue: 0,2:21:28.15,2:21:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,we overdid it.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:29.24,2:21:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,2:21:30.11,2:21:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's alright.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:30.95,2:21:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Apply some medicine\Nand we'll try again.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:33.49,2:21:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Master, you are one who\Naccomplishes great things.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:35.53,2:21:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This is for the fate\Nof the Chan Sect.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:37.32,2:21:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's try a few more times.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:38.03,2:21:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We will get it right eventually.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:39.32,2:21:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Catch him!
Dialogue: 0,2:21:39.86,2:21:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let him run!
Dialogue: 0,2:21:40.57,2:21:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry,
Dialogue: 0,2:21:41.03,2:21:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,put on the medicine quickly!
Dialogue: 0,2:21:41.99,2:21:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Medicine!
Dialogue: 0,2:21:43.24,2:21:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
